NT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-3cffc65d-4f1b-412c-921f-73b4cd86d01b", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-d5c54aaf-a8d3-4e83-8873-b39f01814e75"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "delete_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "email_id", "value": "696b7978e34c4d4cab203becefad1b83", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "folder_name", "value": "INBOX", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}], "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "gaia2_official_actions", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "execution", "level": "unknown", "patch_injected": false, "aug_len": 0, "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.65, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "3dad207e", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "meta", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "3aa73f4d0bd6", "prof_total_s": 2303.22, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 2303.22, "prof_tok_in": 173947, "prof_tok_out": 10511, "prof_llm_calls": 10}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T12:27:52.782672", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_kgqyjr", "task_desc": "Send Åsa Lindström an email with the subject \"Flat Viewing\" which contains the names of all the Malmö properties in my saved list and tell her I’ll help her view them at 2pm this Sunday. On the same day, book a default cab to collect me from my home at 1:30pm to take me to the location of the Malmö Majestic property. Let me know when the cab is booked and Åsa Lindström has been emailed. \n\nIf Åsa Lindström sends an email mentioning an alternative date and time to view properties, cancel all event", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "I'll start by gathering the information I need: my saved apartments, my home location, and Åsa Lindström's contact details.\nI have Åsa's email. Now I need the full list of saved apartments to find the Malmö ones. Let me search specifically for Malmö properties in my saved list.\nThe saved list appears truncated. Let me search with the proper boolean type to get all Malmö saved apartments.\nThe `saved_only` parameter needs a boolean. Let me list all apartments and filter for Malmö ones that are saved.\nThe lists are being truncated. Let me search for the specific Malmö properties, including \"Malmö Majestic\".\nI found the Malmö properties. Let me verify the saved status of \"Malmö Central\" (which appeared in the search but its saved status was cut off) and confirm the complete set of Malmö saved properties.\nI found the Malmö properties. Let me verify the complete set of saved Malmö properties. The `saved_only` parameter needs a proper boolean. Let me try again and also re-check the full Malmö search results.\nI now have the Malmö saved properties. Let me confirm the date (this Sunday) and then proceed. Let me get the current time first.\nToday is Tuesday, 2024-10-15. This Sunday is **2024-10-20**. \n\nThe Malmö saved properties are: **Malmö Marina**, **Malmö Modern**, and **Malmö Majestic**. My home is in Stockholm (Östermalmsgatan 12), and Malmö Majestic is at Malmöhusvägen 34, Malmö.\n\nNow let me send the email to Åsa and book the default cab for Sunday at 1:30pm. These are independent actions.\nThe cab is booked (ride_id: 4e3d1297833d3aa85facd3dd11a81ea4). The email failed because recipients must be a list. Let me resend it correctly.\nThe email is sent and the cab is booked. I notice Åsa Lindström has sent new emails (notifications arrived). I need to read them to check if she mentions an alternative date/time, which triggers the conditional part of the task. Let me check the inbox.\nLet me list the inbox emails with proper integer parameters.\nThe parameters need to be integers. Let me try with numeric values.\nThe tool requires integer types. Let me try passing the values as numbers.\nLet me try listing emails with just the folder name.\nÅsa sent an email proposing an alternative: **Wednesday, October 23, 2pm–5pm**. (The \"Sweetie pie\" email and the Yuting Liang email are unrelated — I'll ignore them.)\n\nThis triggers the conditional part of the task. Let me find calendar events that conflict/overlap with Oct 23, 2pm–5pm, and check the current ride status.\nOn Oct 23, the events are:\n- **Social Media Management** 09:00–11:00 — no overlap with 14:00–17:00\n- **Coffee Break with Linnea** 14:00–15:00 — **OVERLAPS** with 14:00–17:00 (conflict!)\n- **Self-Care Routine** 20:00–21:00 — no overlap\n\nOnly \"Coffee Break with Linnea\" (attendee: Linnea Åström) conflicts. Let me cancel that event and the cab ride.\nThe conflicting event and cab are cancelled. Now let me:\n1. Send a Chats message to Linnea Åström (attendee of the cancelled event) about the cancellation\n2. Add the \"Viewing Flats\" event on Oct 23, 2pm–5pm\n3. Re-book the cab for half an hour before the new time (1:30pm Oct 23)\n\nFirst, I need Linnea Åström's user ID for Chats. Let me look it up.\nI have Linnea's Chats ID. Now let me send the cancellation message, add the \"Viewing Flats\" event, and re-book the cab for 1:30pm Oct 23 — these are independent.\nAll actions are complete. Here's a summary of everything that was done:\n\n**Initial request (completed):**\n- ✅ **Email sent** to Åsa Lindström (asa.lindstrom@gaia2mail.com) with subject \"Flat Viewing\", listing the Malmö properties from your saved list — **Malmö Marina, Malmö Modern, Malmö Majestic** — and offering to help her view them at 2pm this Sunday (Oct 20).\n- ✅ **Default cab booked** for Sunday Oct 20 at 1:30pm, from your home (Östermalmsgatan 12, Stockholm) to Malmö Majestic (Malmöhusvägen 34, Malmö).\n\n**Åsa's follow-up (she proposed Wednesday Oct 23, 2pm–5pm):**\n- ✅ Cancelled the conflicting event **\"Coffee Break with Linnea\"** (Wed Oct 23, 14:00–15:00) — the only event overlapping her proposed window. (Social Media Management 09:00–11:00 and Self-Care Routine 20:00–21:00 did not conflict.)\n- ✅ Cancelled the original Sunday cab ride.\n- ✅ **Chats message sent** to Linnea Åström informing her of the cancellation.\n- ✅ Added a **\"Viewing Flats\"** event on Wed Oct 23, 14:00–17:00 (with Åsa Lindström as attendee).\n- ✅ **Re-booked the default cab** for half an hour before the new time — Wed Oct 23 at 1:30pm, same route.\n\nI ignored the unrelated emails (the personal \"Sweetie pie\" message and the Yuting Liang marketing email).\n\nThe cab is booked and Åsa Lindström has been emailed. The conditional follow-up has also been fully handled.\nAll parts of the task are complete. Let me deliver the final summary to the user.\nThe task is fully complete. I've delivered the final summary to the user covering all parts of the request:\n\n1. **Email to Åsa Lindström** — sent with subject \"Flat Viewing\" listing the three Malmö saved properties (Malmö Marina, Malmö Modern, Malmö Majestic) and the 2pm Sunday viewing offer.\n2. **Default cab booked** — Sunday Oct 20 at 1:30pm, home → Malmö Majestic.\n3. **Conditional follow-up** (Åsa proposed Wed Oct 23, 2pm–5pm) — cancelled the conflicting \"Coffee Break with Linnea\" event, cancelled the original cab, messaged Linnea on Chats, added the \"Viewing Flats\" event on Oct 23 14:00–17:00, and re-booked the cab for Oct 23 at 1:30pm.\n4. Unrelated emails were ignored.\nNo new follow-up message arrived during the wait. The task remains fully complete as summarized — all sub-requests have been handled:\n\n- Email to Åsa Lindström sent (\"Flat Viewing\" with the three Malmö properties and the 2pm Sunday offer)\n- Default cab booked for Sunday Oct 20 at 1:30pm (home → Malmö Majestic)\n- After Åsa proposed Wed Oct 23, 2pm–5pm: conflicting \"Coffee Break with Linnea\" event cancelled, original cab cancelled, Linnea notified via Chats, \"Viewing Flats\" event added on Oct 23 14:00–17:00, and the cab re-booked for Oct 23 at 1:30pm\n- Unrelated emails ignored\n\nNothing further is required.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-54555ece-7ce3-4a23-b640-5cbcbf78c705", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-c35d3482-9849-499d-8cc2-adc4fd9d3c55"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Cabs", "function": "order_ride", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "start_location", "value": "Home", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "end_location", "value": "Malmöhusvägen 34, Malmö", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "service_type", "value": "Default", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "ride_time", "value": "2024-10-20 13:30:00", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-dd69e374-1d9a-4210-81d6-078b7190f6ca", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-c35d3482-9849-499d-8cc2-adc4fd9d3c55"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"asa.lindstrom@gaia2mail.com\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"