{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T12:54:40.801272", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_fed6nl", "task_desc": "Place an order for the only polyester material variant of the Paw Patrol Boys' Group Short Sleeve T-Shirt. After placing the order, send an email to Birgitta Larsson letting her know to cancel the order if she wanted the only red color variant of the Cute Kids Fidget Spinner T-Shirt rather than the product I both. After sending the email to Birgitta Larsson, send me a message confirming that the email has been sent. If the order is canceled, place an order for the other product, then send an ema", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: Place an order for the only polyester material variant of the Paw Patrol Boys' Group Short Sleeve T-Shirt. After placing the order, send an email to B\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll start by searching for the products mentioned in the task.\nI found both products. Let me analyze the variants:\n\n**Paw Patrol Boys' Group Short Sleeve T-Shi\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> ", "response": "I'll start by analyzing this task. Let me break it down:\n\n1. Find and order the only polyester variant of \"Paw Patrol Boys' Group Short Sleeve T-Shirt\"\n2. Send email to Birgitta Larsson about canceling if she wanted the red variant of \"Cute Kids Fidget Spinner T-Shirt\"\n3. Send me a confirmation message\n4. If order is canceled, order the other product and notify Birgitta + me\n\nLet me first search for both products.\nI found both products. Let me analyze the variants:\n\n**Paw Patrol Boys' Group Short Sleeve T-Shirt** - the only polyester variant is item `134d40ff4d60494698228fd0b32f72a6` (Polyester, Blue, 4-6 years).\n\n**Cute Kids Fidget Spinner T-Shirt** - the only red color variant is item `3d0e68b48df64567bb8b9cbc85ecb9b4` (Red, Medium, Cotton).\n\nLet me add the polyester Paw Patrol variant to the cart and place the order.\nI see a notification about an order being cancelled. Let me proceed with checkout first, then investigate the order state.\nThe checkout succeeded with order ID `296a8a7735124879b69f80d5dac438f4`. There was a notification about an order being cancelled, but it referenced a different ID. Let me check the order list to understand the state.\nMy order `296a8a7735124879b69f80d5dac438f4` is \"processed\" (not cancelled). The cancellation notification referenced a different ID, so my order is still active.\n\nNow I need to find Birgitta Larsson's email address to send her the email.\nI found Birgitta Larsson's email: birgitta.larsson@gaia2mail.com\n\nNow let me send the email to Birgitta Larsson about the order cancellation option.\nThe email has been sent to Birgitta Larsson (email ID: f87e1bdca3a3efd5a87d767c17abc655). Now let me send a confirmation message to the user.\nNow I'll wait for a notification about whether the order gets canceled.\nNo cancellation notification arrived. Let me verify the order status to confirm it hasn't been canceled.\nThe order remains \"processed\" and has not been canceled. The conditional branch (placing an order for the other product) only applies if the order is canceled, which it is not.\n\nLet me review the task completion:\n\n1. ✅ **Placed order** for the only polyester variant of the Paw Patrol Boys' Group Short Sleeve T-Shirt (Blue, 4-6 years) — Order #296a8a7735124879b69f80d5dac438f4 (status: processed).\n\n2. ✅ **Sent email** to Birgitta Larsson letting her know to cancel the order if she wanted the only red color variant of the Cute Kids Fidget Spinner T-Shirt rather than the product I bought.\n\n3. ✅ **Sent confirmation message** to you confirming the email was sent.\n\n4. ⏸️ The conditional step (ordering the red Cute Kids Fidget Spinner T-Shirt, emailing Birgitta, and confirming with you) only applies **if the order is canceled**. Since the order is still active/processed and no cancellation occurred, this branch does not apply.\n\nThe task is fully complete. I waited for a cancellation notification (300 seconds) and checked the order status — the order was never canceled, so no further action is required.\nNo new message or notification arrived. The task remains fully complete:\n\n1. ✅ **Order placed** — the only polyester variant of the Paw Patrol Boys' Group Short Sleeve T-Shirt (Blue, 4-6 years), Order #296a8a7735124879b69f80d5dac438f4, status: processed.\n\n2. ✅ **Email sent** to Birgitta Larsson (birgitta.larsson@gaia2mail.com) informing her to cancel the order if she wanted the only red color variant of the Cute Kids Fidget Spinner T-Shirt instead.\n\n3. ✅ **Confirmation message** sent to you confirming the email was sent.\n\n4. ⏸️ The conditional branch (ordering the red Cute Kids Fidget Spinner T-Shirt, notifying Birgitta, and confirming with you) only applies if the order is canceled. The order was never canceled, so this branch does not apply.\n\nThe task is fully done.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-c18f4e95-62e7-49c1-9cb7-fa122366c0fb", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-ab28fbb0-2829-4aa7-accc-27aff5f87320"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Shopping", "function": "add_to_cart", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "item_id", "value": "134d40ff4d60494698228fd0b32f72a6", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "quantity", "value": "1", "value_type": "int"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-c9ebf837-7dac-42f3-bac4-bb9e78e835f2", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-c18f4e95-62e7-49c1-9cb7-fa122366c0fb"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Shopping", "function": "checkout", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "discount_code", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-92362fd4-c091-4815-9394-3c1ebebeb434", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-c9ebf837-7dac-42f3-bac4-bb9e78e835f2"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"birgitta.larsson@gaia2mail.com\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "Order Confirmation", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Hi Birgitta,\n\nIf you wanted the only red color variant of the Cute Kids Fidget Spinner T-Shirt rather than the only polyester material variant of the Paw Patrol Boys' Group Short Sleeve T-Shirt then please cancel the order.\n\nBest,\nAstrid", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-84643d46-b599-4d2d-96d4-3a057ed0ed67", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-92362fd4-c091-4815-9394-3c1ebebeb434"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "AgentUserInterface", "function": "send_message_to_user", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "content", "value": "The email has been sent.", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-a6eb48b8-cd92-4087-b509-e640dc19f98e", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-31b8e097-4c42-4745-9c67-df99ad6eb7f5"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Shopping", "function": "add_to_cart", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "item_id", "value": "3d0e68b48df64567bb8b9cbc85ecb9b4", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "quantity", "value": "1", "value_type": "int"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-c04754b0-aab0-4e04-a1de-00adacf0ee5c", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-a6eb48b8-cd92-4087-b509-e640dc19f98e"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Shopping", "function": "checkout", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "discount_code", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-70a8c215-6089-4c2d-9f1d-43adfa5bd1f8", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-c04754b0-aab0-4e04-a1de-00adacf0ee5c"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"birgitta.larsson@gaia2mail.com\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "Order Placed", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Hi Birgitta,\n\nI have placed a new order for the only red color variant of the Cute Kids Fidget Spinner T-Shirt.\n\nBest,\nAstrid", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-0856425b-6264-458d-be47-c3a35b488971", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-c04754b0-aab0-4e04-a1de-00adacf0ee5c"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "AgentUserInterface", "function": "send_message_to_user", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "content", "value": "A new order has been placed.", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}], "score": 0.5, "em": 0.0, "method": "gaia2_official_actions", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "adaptability", "level": "unknown", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 506, "wc_served": [1.0], "wc_mean": 1.0, "wc_active": 0, "wc_n": 1, "i