{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T12:57:50.819066", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_uig9ac", "task_desc": "Create a new contact in my contact list with the first name Arnold, the last name Schwarzenegger, and the email address arnold@fitness.com. After you have him added, send him an email with the subject \"Biceps Exercises?\" and in the content, ask him for his top 5 biceps exercises. This coming Sunday, create an event titled \"Apartment Tour\" from 2:00 to 4:00 that afternoon. Find the lowest priced property on my saved apartments list in the 211 43 zip code that has a Gym as an amenity and let me kn", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: Create a new contact in my contact list with the first name Arnold, the last name Schwarzenegger, and the email address arnold@fitness.com. After you \nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll break this task into sub-requests and work through them. Let me start with several independent actions: creating the contact, checking the current time, li\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> ", "response": "I'll break this task into sub-requests and work through them. Let me start with several independent actions: creating the contact, checking the current time, listing saved apartments, and looking up Vasco Pinto's user ID.\nThe contact is created, I have Vasco Pinto's user ID, and I have the current time (Tuesday, Oct 15, 2024, so this coming Sunday is Oct 20, 2024). The saved apartments list was truncated, so let me search specifically for saved apartments in the 211 43 zip code with a Gym. Meanwhile, I'll send the email, create the calendar event, and message Vasco Pinto — these are all independent.\nThe email and apartment search had type errors. Let me fix them: recipients needs to be a list, and saved_only needs to be a boolean. Let me retry both, and also get the full saved apartments list to cross-reference.\nThe email, calendar event, and chat message are done. The `saved_only` parameter keeps failing as a string. Let me search all apartments in the 211 43 zip code with a Gym amenity (without the saved_only filter), and I'll cross-reference with the saved list. Let me also try to get the full saved list.\nThe search found exactly one saved apartment in the 211 43 zip code with a Gym amenity: **Malmö Modern** (Södra Förstadsagatan 20, Malmö, price 1300, amenities: Laundry, Gym, saved: true). Since it's the only match, it's also the lowest priced.\n\nNow let me order the default cab ride from Home to that property at 1:00 PM this coming Sunday (Oct 20, 2024).\nAll sub-tasks are complete. Let me provide a summary to the user.\nAll tasks have been completed successfully. Here's a recap of everything I accomplished:\n\n1. **Contact created** — Arnold Schwarzenegger (arnold@fitness.com) added to your contacts.\n2. **Email sent** — \"Biceps Exercises?\" email sent to Arnold asking for his top 5 biceps exercises.\n3. **Calendar event** — \"Apartment Tour\" created for Sunday, Oct 20, 2024, 2:00–4:00 PM.\n4. **Property identified** — **Malmö Modern** (Södra Förstadsagatan 20, Malmö, 211 43) is the only saved apartment in that zip code with a Gym, making it the lowest-priced match (price 1300).\n5. **Cab ordered** — Default cab booked from Home to Malmö Modern at 1:00 PM Sunday, Oct 20.\n6. **Chat message** — Private message sent to Vasco Pinto asking about good gyms in the 211 43 zip code.\nNo new follow-up message arrived during the wait period. All sub-tasks from the original request have been completed:\n\n1. ✅ Created contact Arnold Schwarzenegger (arnold@fitness.com)\n2. ✅ Sent email \"Biceps Exercises?\" asking for his top 5 biceps exercises\n3. ✅ Created \"Apartment Tour\" calendar event for Sunday, Oct 20, 2024, 2:00–4:00 PM\n4. ✅ Found the lowest-priced saved apartment in 211 43 with a Gym: **Malmö Modern**\n5. ✅ Ordered a Default cab from Home to Malmö Modern at 1:00 PM Sunday, Oct 20\n6. ✅ Sent a private Chat message to Vasco Pinto about good gyms in 211 43\n\nThe task is fully done.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-338b1dad-9bc0-4b6d-b3ec-d9c8efa7a9b0", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-56270572-7b98-4c1d-8637-2b85818990e8"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Contacts", "function": "add_new_contact", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "first_name", "value": "Arnold", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "last_name", "value": "Schwarzenegger", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "gender", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "age", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[int]"}, {"name": "nationality", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "city_living", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "country", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "status", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "job", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "description", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "phone", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "email", "value": "arnold@fitness.com", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "address", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-df0c1253-f02a-4f7c-8d4a-39cb25d3fc64", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-56270572-7b98-4c1d-8637-2b85818990e8"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "add_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "title", "value": "Apartment Tour", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "start_datetime", "value": "2024-10-20 14:00:00", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "end_datetime", "value": "2024-10-20 16:00:0