{"name": "attachment_path", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975602.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-349f91d9-3361-4698-9bfc-e1960e02f41a", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-338b1dad-9bc0-4b6d-b3ec-d9c8efa7a9b0"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"arnold@fitness.com\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "Biceps Exercises?", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Hi Arnold,\n\nWhat are your top 5 biceps exercises?\n\nBest,\nAstrid Lundqvist", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}], "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "method": "gaia2_official_actions", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "execution", "level": "unknown", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 510, "wc_served": [1.0], "wc_mean": 1.0, "wc_active": 0, "wc_n": 1, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.85, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "3dad207e", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "meta", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "3aa73f4d0bd6", "prof_total_s": 2612.01, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 2612.01, "prof_tok_in": 158593, "prof_tok_out": 4380, "prof_llm_calls": 9}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T12:58:32.949240", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_d0wx3m", "task_desc": "Please send a Chats message to Akira to let her know that I'm good to attend her birthday party. Notify me once you have sent the message to Akira. When she sets up the calendar invite, please cancel any conflicting events that are scheduled in my calendar at the same time as the event Akira sets up. Book me a premium cab ride to pick me up at home to take me to the address she includes as the event's location. Have the ride pick me up 30 minutes before the party is scheduled. Send a group email", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: Please send a Chats message to Akira to let her know that I'm good to attend her birthday party. Notify me once you have sent the message to Akira. Wh\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll break this task into sub-requests:\n1. Send a Chats message to Akira confirming I'll attend her birthday party\n2. Notify you once the message is sent\n3. Wai\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> ", "response": "I'll break this task into sub-requests:\n1. Send a Chats message to Akira confirming I'll attend her birthday party\n2. Notify you once the message is sent\n3. When Akira sets up the calendar invite, cancel any conflicting events in my calendar at the same time\n4. Book a premium cab ride from home to the event location, picking me up 30 minutes before the party\n5. Send a group email to anyone affected by the cancelled events to apologize\n\nLet me start by finding Akira's user ID and checking the current calendar state.\nI found Akira's user ID. The search shows existing events with Akira as an attendee, but no birthday party invite yet — that's something she'll set up later. Let me first send the Chats message to Akira confirming attendance.\nI've sent the message to Akira. Now I need to wait for her to set up the calendar invite (the \"when\" condition in the task). Let me wait for that notification.\nAkira has added a new calendar event. Let me find the birthday party event she set up.\nAkira's birthday bash is on Friday, 2024-10-25 from 17:00 to 23:00 at Regeringsgatan 74, 111 38 Stockholm. Now let me find any conflicting events in my calendar during that time range.\nI found two conflicting events that overlap with Akira's Birthday Bash (17:00–23:00):\n1. **Yoga Class** (18:00–19:00) — attendee: Linnea Åström\n2. **Networking Event** (19:00–21:00) — attendees: Linnea Åström, Sunita Bishwakarma\n\nLet me cancel both conflicting events.\nBoth conflicting events are cancelled. Now I'll book the premium cab ride (pickup 30 min before 17:00 = 16:30 on 2024-10-25) and look up the affected attendees' contact details for the apology email.\nThe premium cab is booked. Now I'll send a group email to the affected attendees (Linnea Åström and Sunita Bishwakarma) to apologize and let them know I can't make it.\nThe recipients need to be a list. Let me retry.\nAll sub-requests are now complete. Let me notify you with a summary of everything that was accomplished.\nAll tasks have been completed successfully:\n\n1. **Chats message to Akira** — Sent confirming you'll attend her birthday party.\n2. **Notification** — Provided a full summary of completed actions.\n3. **Conflicting events cancelled** — Yoga Class and Networking Event (both on Friday, 2024-10-25) were deleted as they overlapped with Akira's Birthday Bash (17:00–23:00).\n4. **Premium cab booked** — Home pickup at 16:30 (30 min before the party), drop-off at Regeringsgatan 74, 111 38 Stockholm.\n5. **Group apology email** — Sent to Linnea Åström and Sunita Bishwakarma, the attendees affected by the cancelled events.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-5a385242-87b9-4bbe-8562-497482c2104f", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-2dd32184-97c1-4dac-8844-a9f904a76f17"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Chats", "function": "send_message", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "user_id", "value": "b6f1ec1a-01b4-4e41-b31a-b3d7a87ecde0", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Hey Akira, just confirming that I'm good to attend your birthday party!", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "attachment_path", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975602.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-0e4afd65-f905-4875-a282-e6f269538eb3", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-5a385242-87b9-4bbe-8562-497482c2104f"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "AgentUserInterface", "function": "send_message_to_user", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "content", "value": "I sent the message to Akira.", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975663.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-af79c207-79f5-4c8c-b69a-e5527b8c987d", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-61a632de-20ae-49f3-bfd2-c49292820975"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "b87b0e6f2b1a4f58a19e1bc5d694b315", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975663.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-a9ea399c-4bd0-45b3-b475-d03b4b2f67c5", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-61a632de-20ae-49f3-bfd2-c49292820975"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "34a7b40d268c4cad8a36277700628699", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975663.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-04f87b08-166c-43fb-b26e-c3858cf4ce3c", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-61a632de-20ae-49f3-bfd2-c49292820975"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Cabs", "function": "order_ride", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "start_location", "value": "Home", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "end_location", "value": "Regeringsgatan 74, 111 38 Stockholm", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "service_type", "value": "Premium", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "ride_time", "value": "2024-10-25 16:30:00", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975663.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-6c4df87e-177c-4a16-8d2d-4d55a8aa9849", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-61a632de-20ae-49f3-bfd2-c49292820975"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"linnea.astrom@gaia2mail.com\",\"sunita.bishwakarma@gaia2mail.com\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "Cancellation of Events", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Dear Linnea and Sunita,\n\nUnfortunately, I need to cancel our previously scheduled events due to a conflicting commitment. I apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and appreciate your understanding.\n\nBest regards,\nAstrid Lundqvist", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}], "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "method": "gaia2_official_actions", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "adaptability", "level": "unknown", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 506, "wc_served": [1.0], "wc_mean": 1.0, "wc_active": 0, "wc_n": 1, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.8, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "3dad207e", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "meta", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "3aa73f4d0bd6", "prof_total_s": 2696.32, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 2696.32, "prof_tok_in": 190460, "prof_tok_out": 8252, "prof_llm_calls": 11}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T12:58:48.039858", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_7tb9tp", "task_desc": "Yinyin Liang  asked me to buy a Dreamworks Trolls BFF Blanket in cotton, 50x60 size, in Pastel Rainbow color, so please buy that. I’m not sure if this is the right size though, so please send an email to Yinyin asking if 50x60 is the right size or not. Let me know once you have made the purchase and sent the email. If she replies with a different item to be purchased, cancel the order and make a new one with the new item, and then reply to her saying I ordered the correct one. If there are multi", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: Yinyin Liang  asked me to buy a Dreamworks Trolls BFF Blanket in cotton, 50x60 size, in Pastel Rainbow color, so please buy that. I’m not sure if this\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll start by searching for the Dreamworks Trolls BFF Blanket to find products matching Yinyin's criteria.\nI found the product. Let me analyze the variants agai\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> ", "response": "I'll start by searching for the Dreamworks Trolls BFF Blanket to find products matching Yinyin's criteria.\nI found the product. Let me analyze the variants against Yinyin's criteria (Cotton, 50x60, Pastel Rainbow):\n- `8753e712acc2452a904eebe1d08ee004`: Cotton, 50x60, Pastel Rainbow, $17.99 ✓ (available)\n- `83051239f2d84e0e9b8dd5161012bc17`: Fleece, 50x60, Pastel Rainbow (wrong material)\n- `ccffeb2e59ac4a67be5dfc1a89e613e8`: Cotton, 40x50, Pastel Rainbow (wrong size)\n- `692638615a6846c090c377d1b666884e`: Cotton, 50x60, Bright Rainbow (wrong color, unavailable)\n\nOnly one variant matches all criteria. Let me add it to cart and find Yinyin's contact info to send the email.\nThe cart add failed due to quantity type. Let me retry without the quantity parameter (defaults to 1).\nItem added to cart. Now let me checkout the order.\nOrder placed successfully (order ID: `dec47af51c964e93909ee4901e8edccb`). I notice there's a new email from Yinyin. Let me first send my email asking about the size, then check her incoming email.\nThe recipients parameter needs to be a list. Let me retry.\nEmail sent. Now let me check the email Yinyin sent (received at checkout time) to see if she replied with a different item.\nYinyin replied: \"No, I asked you to buy the 40x50 size. Please order the correct one!\" \n\nI need to cancel the current order and make a new one with the 40x50 cotton Pastel Rainbow variant (`ccffeb2e59ac4a67be5dfc1a89e613e8`). Let me cancel the order first.\nOrder cancelled. Now let me add the correct 40x50 cotton Pastel Rainbow variant to the cart and checkout.\nNew order placed (order ID: `e777d80ebc49471195b6f909cc74f3dc`) with the correct 40x50 cotton Pastel Rainbow blanket. Now let me reply to Yinyin saying I ordered the correct one.\nAll tasks are complete. Let me summarize what was done:\n\n**Summary:**\n1. **Searched** for the Dreamworks Trolls BFF Blanket and found the matching variant (Cotton, 50x60, Pastel Rainbow, $17.99).\n2. **Placed the initial order** for the 50x60 cotton Pastel Rainbow blanket (order `dec47af51c964e93909ee4901e8edccb`).\n3. **Sent an email** to Yinyin (yinyin.liang@km.gov.cn) asking whether 50x60 was the correct size.\n4. **Yinyin replied**: \"No, I asked you to buy the 40x50 size. Please order the correct one!\"\n5. **Cancelled** the original order.\n6. **Placed a new order** for the correct item — Cotton, 40x50, Pastel Rainbow (order `e777d80ebc49471195b6f909cc74f3dc`).\n7. **Replied to Yinyin** confirming I ordered the correct one.\n\nThe purchase has been made (correct 40x50 size) and the email exchange is complete.\nThe task is fully complete. I have:\n- Purchased the correct item (Dreamworks Trolls BFF Blanket, Cotton, 40x50, Pastel Rainbow) after Yinyin clarified the size\n- Cancelled the original incorrect 50x60 order\n- Sent the initial size-confirmation email and the follow-up reply confirming the correct order was placed", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-206ab9f3-7337-4e8e-bf87-a4d217bd3d73", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-71ecbfe2-3517-435d-a896-d4da47b3fb89"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Shopping", "function": "add_to_cart", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "item_id", "value": "8753e712acc2452a904eebe1d08ee004", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "quantity", "value": "1", "value_type": "int"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-7f705384-1b8c-4269-bb29-b02f3bf081d7", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-71ecbfe2-3517-435d-a896-d4da47b3fb89"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"yinyin.liang@km.gov.cn\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "Confirming Blanket Size", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Dear Yinyin,\n\nIs 50x60 the correct size for the Dreamworks Trolls BFF Blanket you asked me to buy?\n\nBest,\nAstrid", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975602.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-770be5d5-46bd-4af2-a1c9-049cd2bc2be5", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-206ab9f3-7337-4e8e-bf87-a4d217bd3d73"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Shopping", "function": "checkout", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "discount_code", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975603.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-c26d7916-1720-4a9b-b6aa-615025b0a88d", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-770be5d5-46bd-4af2-a1c9-049cd2bc2be5", "OracleEvent-AGENT-7f705384-1b8c-4269-bb29-b02f3bf081d7"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "AgentUserInterface", "function": "send_message_to_user", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "content", "value": "I made the purchase and sent an email to your friend, Yinyin Liang, to confirm the blanket size.", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975639.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-f41a381f-59fd-4746-9845-19bbd054abfe", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-99e3f2c2-97cd-4e24-99d2-bd2e1d56d674"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Shopping", "function": "add_to_cart", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "item_id", "value": "ccffeb2e59ac4a67be5dfc1a89e613e8", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "quantity", "value": "1", "value_type": "int"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975639.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-ffdaa254-0cf6-411d-9468-44dd323fec50", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-99e3f2c2-97cd-4e24-99d2-bd2e1d56d674"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Shopping", "function": "cancel_order", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "order_id", "value": "{{OracleEvent-AGENT-770be5d5-46bd-4af2-a1c9-049cd2bc2be5}}", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975640.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-8659d159-07f4-434e-9b68-31af80b3615a", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-f41a381f-59fd-4746-9845-19bbd054abfe"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Shopping", "function": "checkout", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "discount_code", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975641.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-2f36b201-f679-403e-a80a-1e524f641506", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-8659d159-07f4-434e-9b68-31af80b3615a", "OracleEvent-AGENT-ffdaa254-0cf6-411d-9468-44dd323fec50"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "reply_to_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "email_id", "value": "{{Event-ENV-99e3f2c2-97cd-4e24-99d2-bd2e1d56d674}}", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "folder_name", "value": "INBOX", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Dear Yinyin,\n\nI ordered the correct one.\n\nBest,\nAstrid Lundqvist", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}], "score": 0.875, "em": 0.0, "method": "gaia2_official_actions", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "adaptability", "level": "unknown", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 522, "wc_served": [1.0], "wc_mean": 1.0, "wc_active": 0, "wc_n": 1, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.5, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "3dad207e", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "meta", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "3aa73f4d0bd6", "prof_total_s": 2605.95, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 2605.95, "prof_tok_in": 217855, "prof_tok_out": 2953, "prof_llm_calls": 13}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T12:59:28.501637", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_a6n7ro", "task_desc": "Find the address for the Malmö Opera, I took a cab there once. Schedule a van ride to pick me up from my  vacation house in Malmö, located at Norra Vallgatan 62, 211 22 Malmö, to the Malmö Opera on 10/19/2024 at 6 pm. Also, add \"Night at the Opera\" to the calendar for 10/19/2024 from 7 pm - 11 pm at Malmö Opera. Email Vasco the details about the event and let him know the cab ride will be picking us up at my house. Delete all my events for today as well. This is supposed to be a special night, a", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: Find the address for the Malmö Opera, I took a cab there once. Schedule a van ride to pick me up from my  vacation house in Malmö, located at Norra Va\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll work through this task carefully. Let me start by gathering the information I need: the Malmö Opera address (from my cab ride history), my own details (to \nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> ", "response": "I'll work through this task carefully. Let me start by gathering the information I need: the Malmö Opera address (from my cab ride history), my own details (to find my house), today's calendar events (to delete), and Vasco's contact info.\nI found today's events to delete and three \"Vasco\" contacts (a genuine ambiguity). Let me retry the cab ride history with the correct integer type to find the Malmö Opera address.\nThe history call keeps erroring on type. Let me try the length function and a single ride lookup instead.\nThe integer arguments are being rejected. Let me try passing them as raw numbers without quotes.\nThe cab history functions reject string-typed integer arguments. Let me try passing the integers as raw numbers (no quotes) for the history call.\nThe cab history functions reject integer arguments (a tool schema mismatch), so I can't read the ride history directly. Let me try to surface the Malmö Opera address through the cab quotation and ride-listing functions instead, which accept string locations.\nThe cab functions recognize \"Malmö Opera\" as a valid location. I still need the actual street address, which the task says is in my cab ride history. Let me try the history call with default arguments (no offset/limit) to work around the type issue.\nI found the ride history (default call returns 6 rides, but none are to Malmö Opera yet). I need to page through more rides to find the Malmö Opera trip. Let me try paginating.\nThe default call worked but only returned 6 rides (history has 30). I need to page further. Let me try passing offset/limit as raw numbers (no quotes) to satisfy the int type.\nThe default call returns only the first 6 rides, but the history has 30 and none are to Malmö Opera yet. I need to paginate, but offset/limit keep getting rejected as strings. Let me try passing only `limit` (no offset) to see if a single argument avoids the type error.\nThe default history call returns only the first 6 rides (none to Malmö Opera), and the offset/limit parameters are rejected as strings by the tool (a schema/implementation mismatch I can't work around). Let me find the Malmö Opera address through other sources — searching calendar events and emails for \"Opera\".\nNo calendar or email references to the Opera. The ride history has 30 rides but the tool only returns the first 6 (the offset/limit params are rejected as strings, a harness limitation I can't bypass). Let me check other sources for the Malmö Opera address — contacts and files.\nI've gathered the key facts. Let me note what I have and what's ambiguous:\n\n**Findings:**\n- Today's events to delete: Photoshoot (09:00–12:00), Networking Event (18:00–20:00), Self-Care Routine (20:00–21:00).\n- The cab system recognizes \"Malmö Opera\" as a valid destination, so I can book the van ride there.\n- **Ambiguity 1:** There are **three** \"Vasco\" contacts (Martins, Pinto, Pereira) — I need to know which one to email.\n- **Ambiguity 2:** I could not retrieve the exact Malmö Opera *street address* from the cab ride history. The history tool only returns the first few rides (and its pagination parameters are broken in this environment), and none of the visible rides went to the Opera. No calendar/email/contact entry contains the Opera address either.\n\nLet me proceed with the unambiguous actions (delete today's events, add the calendar event, order the van ride), then clarify the two open points with you.\nI've completed the actions I'm confident about. Before emailing Vasco, I need to clarify two things, since the task explicitly asked me to check when unsure. Let me send you a message.\nI've sent my clarifying questions. Now I'll wait for your response before emailing Vasco.\nNo reply yet. Let me wait a bit longer in case you respond.\nI've waited a total of 10 minutes with no reply. Since the email to Vasco is blocked on genuine ambiguity (three contacts named Vasco) and the Opera address couldn't be retrieved from the ride history, I'll stop here and leave the task in a clear state. Let me send a final status summary.\nI've completed everything that's unambiguous and clearly flagged the two items that genuinely require your input. Here's the final summary:\n\n**Completed:**\n- ✅ Deleted all 3 of today's events (Photoshoot 9–12, Networking Event 18–20, Self-Care Routine 20–21)\n- ✅ Added \"Night at the Opera\" to the calendar for 10/19/2024, 7:00–11:00 pm at Malmö Opera\n- ✅ Booked the Van ride from Norra Vallgatan 62, 211 22 Malmö → Malmö Opera on 10/19/2024 at 6:00 pm (confirmed/BOOKED)\n\n**Awaiting your clarification (as you requested, since I'm unsure):**\n1. **Which Vasco?** You have three contacts named Vasco — Martins, Pinto, and Pereira. I won't guess which one to email.\n2. **Malmö Opera street address:** I couldn't retrieve it from your cab ride history — the ride-history tool only returned your 6 most recent rides (none to the Opera) and its pagination is unavailable in this environment, so I couldn't page back to the Opera trip. I booked the van to \"Malmö Opera,\" which the cab system recognizes and geocodes correctly. Let me know if you'd prefer a specific street address.\n\nOnce you tell me which Vasco to email (and the address if you have it), I'll send the email with the event details and the note that the cab will pick you up at your house.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-0f009f67-5db9-45ca-a93a-d8930d451233", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-f55bfb57-6795-4539-bff0-ab231b9d96c9"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "add_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "title", "value": "Night at the Opera", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "start_datetime", "value": "2024-10-19 19:00:00", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "end_datetime", "value": "2024-10-19 23:00:00", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "tag", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "description", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "location", "value": "Malmö Opera", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "attendees", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-9acec066-ba26-4765-b477-c11d567c172f", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-f55bfb57-6795-4539-bff0-ab231b9d96c9"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "d2f892cf34ab4e16be08eb6dbfd01727", "value_typ