{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T13:03:13.189664", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_hwe7io", "task_desc": "Send an email with the subject \"Egypt\" to Viggo Mikkelsen and attach the picture with the filename containing Egypt. Tell him I'm taking off November 30, 2024 - December 7, 2024, for our trip to Egypt. Cancel everything on my schedule during that time period and then schedule \"Trip to Egypt\" with Viggo Mikkelsen from 11/30/2024 at 7 am - 12/7/2024 at 7 pm. Order one of the Funforge Kingsport Festival the Card Game, the English version for 1-2 players for the trip. Send a Messages message to Åke ", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: Send an email with the subject \"Egypt\" to Viggo Mikkelsen and attach the picture with the filename containing Egypt. Tell him I'm taking off November \nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll break this task into sub-requests and work through them. Let me start by gathering the information I need: finding Viggo Mikkelsen's contact info, the Egyp\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> ", "response": "I'll break this task into sub-requests:\n1. Send email to Viggo Mikkelsen (subject \"Egypt\", attach Egypt picture, mention trip dates)\n2. Cancel all schedule events during 11/30/2024 - 12/7/2024\n3. Schedule \"Trip to Egypt\" with Viggo Mikkelsen 11/30 7am - 12/7 7pm\n4. Order Funforge Kingsport Festival Card Game (English, 1-2 players)\n5. Send Messages message to Åke about cats/house\n\nLet me gather the needed information first.\nLet me find the Egypt picture and look up Åke with a different approach.\nLet me search the Pictures subdirectories and look for Åke more broadly.\nFound the Egypt picture: `/Pictures/Personal/Travels/Egypt_2021.jpg`. Now let me find Åke's user ID by listing conversations (the offset needs to be an integer).\nLet me try listing conversations with an integer offset and check contacts for Åke.\nI found three Åke contacts, which is ambiguous. Let me first handle the unambiguous tasks, then ask about which Åke. Let me send the email, check the calendar, and add the game to cart.\nThe calendar shows 3 events during that period (all on 11/30). Let me fix the email and cart calls with proper types.\nEmail sent. Let me add the game to cart without the quantity argument (defaults to 1).\nNow let me cancel the 3 calendar events during the trip period and schedule the \"Trip to Egypt\" event.\nNow let me checkout the order for the game.\nI've completed most of the tasks. However, there are three contacts named \"Åke\" in the contacts list, and the Messages tool requires a specific phone number (user ID). I need to clarify which Åke to message before sending.\n\nThe three Åke contacts are:\n- **Åke Lundqvist** (Social Worker, Stockholm) — phone +46701234567\n- **Åke Lindström** (Film Producer, Stockholm) — phone +46702123456\n- **Åke Svensson** (Scout Manager, Stockholm) — phone not fully shown\n\nLet me ask the user which one to message.\nI've asked the user for clarification about which Åke to message. Let me wait for their response.\nNo response yet. Let me wait a bit longer for the user's reply.\nStill no response. Let me wait once more for the user's clarification.\nI've waited 15 minutes with no response. Let me do one final wait before reporting the status.\nI've completed all the unambiguous parts of your request and asked for clarification on the one ambiguous item (which Åke to message). I waited 20 minutes for a reply but haven't received one. Here's the final status:\n\n**✅ Completed:**\n1. **Email to Viggo Mikkelsen** — Sent with subject \"Egypt\", attached the Egypt picture (`Egypt_2021.jpg`), and told him you're taking off Nov 30 – Dec 7, 2024 for the Egypt trip.\n2. **Calendar cleared** — Cancelled all 3 events during that period (Content Creation, Social Media Analytics, Relaxation Time, all on 11/30).\n3. **\"Trip to Egypt\" scheduled** — With Viggo Mikkelsen, 11/30/2024 7:00 AM → 12/7/2024 7:00 PM.\n4. **Game ordered** — Funforge Kingsport Festival the Card Game (English, 1–2 players) — order placed.\n\n**⏳ Pending your input:**\n- **Messages to Åke** — There are three contacts named \"Åke\" (Lundqvist, Lindström, Svensson), and the Messages app needs a specific phone number. I need you to tell me which one should receive the message asking to stay at your house and care for your cats during the trip dates.\n\nPlease reply with which Åke, and I'll send that message immediately.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-04a2dcc0-a99d-463d-b1e0-00126626b4ab", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-02b62099-a29d-49e1-ac70-ee40c196a0ca"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "a7355cc7556d47e084d9b664f47589c0", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-b7bf19d7-5314-4f9a-a7bf-d04c991fda03", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-02b62099-a29d-49e1-ac70-ee40c196a0ca"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "a7f34e9a94424437985bc1c6f8dd3234", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-9e9197c8-404c-4427-8666-3e1465ae5e6a", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-02b62099-a29d-49e1-ac70-ee40c196a0ca"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "