{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T13:11:37.510532", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_jywgsj", "task_desc": "On my calendar, cancel the brand partnership meeting on 10/19 at 2 PM. Create a calendar event for a gym session on 10/19 from 9 AM to 10 AM. Remove Lund Living from my saved property list. Save Uppsala Urban to my saved list. Purchase the Rubie's Adult Star Wars Stormtrooper Glovelettes in latex material. Remove Åke Svensson from my contact list.", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: On my calendar, cancel the brand partnership meeting on 10/19 at 2 PM. Create a calendar event for a gym session on 10/19 from 9 AM to 10 AM. Remove L\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll break this task into sub-requests and work through them. Let me start by gathering information on several items in parallel.\nLet me gather more details. I \nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> ", "response": "I'll break this task into sub-tasks and work through them. Let me start by gathering information on several items in parallel.\nI have most of the information. Let me gather more details: find the 10/19 Brand Partnership Meeting, locate the apartments, and proceed with the independent actions.\nI now have all the details. Let me complete the remaining actions: delete the meeting, create the gym event, remove Lund Living, save Uppsala Urban, and checkout the purchase.\nAll tasks have been completed successfully. Here's a summary of what I did:\n\n1. **Cancelled the Brand Partnership Meeting** on 10/19 at 2 PM (Saturday, 2024-10-19 14:00–16:00) — deleted from calendar.\n\n2. **Created a Gym Session event** on 10/19 from 9 AM to 10 AM (Saturday, 2024-10-19 09:00–10:00), tagged \"Health\".\n\n3. **Removed Lund Living** from your saved property list.\n\n4. **Saved Uppsala Urban** to your saved property list.\n\n5. **Purchased the Rubie's Adult Star Wars Stormtrooper Glovelettes** in the Latex material variant (White, One Size) — order placed successfully.\n\n6. **Removed Åke Svensson** from your contact list.\n\nAll six sub-tasks are complete.\nAll sub-tasks have already been completed successfully. Let me deliver the final summary to the user.\nAll six sub-tasks have been completed and the final summary has been delivered to the user:\n\n1. ✅ Cancelled the Brand Partnership Meeting on 10/19 at 2 PM\n2. ✅ Created the Gym Session event on 10/19 from 9 AM to 10 AM\n3. ✅ Removed Lund Living from saved properties\n4. ✅ Saved Uppsala Urban to saved properties\n5. ✅ Purchased the Rubie's Adult Star Wars Stormtrooper Glovelettes (Latex)\n6. ✅ Removed Åke Svensson from contacts", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-b7a409b5-342b-4572-a262-e2dc3b9c65f0", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-8c002820-4d30-4b32-bc0b-a673fee43b9c"], "event_relative_time": 1, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "add_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "title", "value": "Gym Session", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "start_datetime", "value": "2024-10-19 09:00:00", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "end_datetime", "value": "2024-10-19 10:00:00", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "tag", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "description", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "location", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "attendees", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-fcf78e82-ba04-413e-9ac3-af0637ec2260", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-8c002820-4d30-4b32-bc0b-a673fee43b9c"], "event_relative_time": 1, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "RentAFlat", "function": "remove_saved_apartment", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"