{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T13:11:43.865101", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_ztxch4", "task_desc": "Cancel the only work tagged event scheduled for today and send a message on Chats telling the attendee that I cannot make it. Schedule 'Doctor's Visit' on my calendar today from 8:00 AM to 9:00 AM with Linnégatan 18, 413 04 Goteborg as the location. Book a default cab ride to pick me up at 7:30 AM from my home to take me to the location of the Doctor's Visit. Order one of each of the available versions of the Bachmann Trains Great Northern Gondola as a gift for the doctor's staff.", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: Cancel the only work tagged event scheduled for today and send a message on Chats telling the attendee that I cannot make it. Schedule 'Doctor's Visit\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll break this task into sub-requests:\n1. Cancel the only work-tagged event today and message its attendee on Chats\n2. Schedule \"Doctor's Visit\" today 8-9 AM a\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> ", "response": "I'll break this task into sub-requests:\n1. Cancel the only work-tagged event today and message its attendee on Chats\n2. Schedule \"Doctor's Visit\" today 8-9 AM at Linnégatan 18, 413 04 Goteborg\n3. Book a default cab at 7:30 AM from home to the Doctor's Visit location\n4. Order one of each version of the Bachmann Trains Great Northern Gondola\n\nLet me start by gathering information.\nI have the information I need. Let me analyze:\n\n- **Work-tagged event today**: \"Photoshoot\" (9:00-12:00) with attendee Kasper Rønnow — this is the only Work event. I'll cancel it and message Kasper on Chats.\n- **Doctor's Visit**: schedule 8-9 AM at Linnégatan 18, 413 04 Goteborg.\n- **Cab**: default ride at 7:30 AM from home (Östermalmsgatan 12, 114 39 Stockholm) to the Doctor's location.\n- **Bachmann Trains Great Northern Gondola**: 3 variants, but only 2 are available (HO/Plastic/Metal $22.38 and HO/Plastic/Plastic $19.99). The N scale is unavailable, so I'll order the 2 available versions.\n\nLet me execute the independent actions and look up Kasper's Chats ID.\nThe event was deleted, Doctor's Visit added, cab booked, and Kasper's Chats ID found. The cart additions failed due to quantity type — let me retry with integer quantity and send the Chats message to Kasper.\nThe Chats message was sent. The cart additions still fail with the quantity type — let me try without specifying quantity (default is 1, which is what I want).\nBoth items added to cart. Let me verify the cart and then checkout.\nThe cart has both available versions (one of each). Now let me checkout.\nAll sub-tasks are complete. Let me provide a summary.\nAll tasks have been completed successfully:\n\n1. ✅ **Cancelled the work event** — Deleted the \"Photoshoot\" (the only Work-tagged event today) with Kasper Rønnow.\n2. ✅ **Messaged the attendee on Chats** — Sent Kasper a message explaining you can't make it.\n3. ✅ **Scheduled Doctor's Visit** — Today 8:00–9:00 AM at Linnégatan 18, 413 04 Goteborg.\n4. ✅ **Booked a default cab** — 7:30 AM pickup from home to the Doctor's location (BOOKED).\n5. ✅ **Ordered the Bachmann Trains Great Northern Gondola** — One of each of the 2 available versions (the N-scale variant was out of stock). Order placed.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-81496b91-ca93-44f9-aad1-8276258b71db", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-99c63400-a0c9-4a57-bc1a-dbf6a16faa79"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "d2f892cf34ab4e16be08eb6dbfd01727", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": 