{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T13:18:41.938329", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_5e0gvz", "task_desc": "I need to book a whole day with my friend who’s a Film Producer in Stockholm. Cancel any appointments I have scheduled for this upcoming Saturday and schedule an event titled “Film Production Day” from 8 AM to 8 PM on that day, adding my friend as an attendee. Send him an email after scheduling the event, with the appointment details. Let me know when you’ve done these things. If my friend says he can’t make it, accept any suggested date and time he proposes and reschedule the “Film Production D", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: I need to book a whole day with my friend who’s a Film Producer in Stockholm. Cancel any appointments I have scheduled for this upcoming Saturday and \nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll start by gathering the information I need: finding my friend (Film Producer in Stockholm), confirming the current date, and checking my calendar for this u\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> ", "response": "I'll start by gathering the information I need: finding my friend (Film Producer in Stockholm), confirming the current date, and getting my user details.\nThe search returned no results. Let me search more broadly for my friend.\nLet me list all contacts with the correct offset type.\nThe contacts list is paginated. Let me get the next page of contacts to find my friend.\nThe offset needs to be an integer. Let me try passing it as a number.\nThe offset parameter is being rejected. Let me try different search queries to find my friend.\nI found my friend: **Åke Lindström**, a Film Producer in Stockholm (email: ake.lindstrom@filmproduktion.se).\n\nCurrent date is Tuesday, 2024-10-15, so the upcoming Saturday is **2024-10-19**. Let me check my calendar for that day.\nI have one appointment on Saturday: \"Brand Partnership Meeting\" (14:00–16:00). I'll cancel it and schedule the \"Film Production Day\" event. These are independent, so I'll do both now.\nThe appointment was cancelled and the \"Film Production Day\" event was scheduled (event ID: a6f807f2c8c09795b8351b2eef49916a). Now let me send Åke an email with the appointment details.\nThe recipients parameter needs to be a list. Let me retry.\nThe email was sent. I see two new emails arrived, including one from Åke (ake.lindstrom@filmproduktion.se). Let me read his response since it's critical to the conditional part of the task.\nÅke can't make it on Saturday and suggested **Thursday, October 17** at the same time (8 AM–8 PM). Per the task, I need to:\n1. Reschedule \"Film Production Day\" to Thursday, Oct 17, 8 AM–8 PM\n2. Cancel any appointments I have on Thursday, Oct 17\n\nLet me first check my calendar for Thursday, Oct 17.\nÅke proposed Thursday, Oct 17 at the same time (8 AM–8 PM). I have 5 appointments on Thursday that must be cancelled, and I need to reschedule the Film Production Day event from Saturday to Thursday. Since there's no edit function, I'll delete the Saturday event and the 5 Thursday appointments, then create the new Thursday event. These are all independent, so I'll do them together.\nAll deletions and the rescheduled event creation succeeded. Let me verify the final calendar state for both Thursday and Saturday.\nEverything is verified and complete. Let me notify the user.\nThe task is fully complete. Here's what was accomplished:\n\n1. **Found the friend** — Åke Lindström, Film Producer in Stockholm.\n2. **Cancelled Saturday appointments** — Removed the \"Brand Partnership Meeting\" on Oct 19.\n3. **Scheduled \"Film Production Day\"** — Oct 19, 8 AM–8 PM, Stockholm, with Åke as attendee.\n4. **Sent the email** — With full appointment details to Åke.\n5. **Handled Åke's reply** — He couldn't make Saturday and proposed Thursday, Oct 17 at the same time. I rescheduled the event to Thursday Oct 17 (8 AM–8 PM) and cancelled all 5 of my Thursday appointments, leaving the calendar clean for the rescheduled day.\n\nAll sub-requests have been satisfied and verified.\nNo new follow-up message arrived within the wait window. The task has been fully completed and verified:\n\n- Found friend Åke Lindström (Film Producer, Stockholm)\n- Cancelled Saturday (Oct 19) appointment\n- Scheduled \"Film Production Day\" (Oct 19, 8 AM–8 PM)\n- Emailed Åke the details\n- Handled his reply: rescheduled to Thursday, Oct 17 (8 AM–8 PM) and cancelled all 5 of my Thursday appointments\n\nNo further action is needed.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-9ca29aa0-de61-43b9-8784-1181580bc6b2", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-18ffbb0b-c192-4b7d-8c98-352ac9ba1008"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "add_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "title", "value": "Film Production Day", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "start_datetime", "value": "2024-10-19 08:00:00", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "end_datetime", "value": "2024-10-19 20:00:00", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "tag", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "description", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "location", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "attendees", "value": "[\"Åke Lindström\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-5a7544b9-62b6-451e-b485-f2628cc66444", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-18ffbb0b-c192-4b7d-8c98-352ac9ba1008"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "f041377cce14424692cf96b15fc4fd0b", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-8ad56d85-3053-444a-9141-9fdcba7aac68", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-9ca29aa0-de61-43b9-8784-1181580bc6b2"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"ake.lindstrom@filmproduktion.se\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "Film Production Day", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Dear Åke,\n\nI've scheduled a \"Film Production Day\" event for this upcoming Saturday, October 19, 2024, from 8 AM to 8 PM. \n\nBest,\nAstrid Lundqvist", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-78d99363-08cd-4a69-a6b4-dd85160292dd", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-8ad56d85-3053-444a-9141-9fdcba7aac68", "OracleEvent-AGENT-5a7544b9-62b6-451e-b485-f2628cc66444"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "AgentUserInterface", "function": "send_message_to_user", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "content", "value": "The things you requested have been done.", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-f1eeb388-b7fe-4694-a361-061c9ca6df30", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-db27d521-bdb2-4e54-93c7-9020aad11998"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "{{OracleEvent-AGENT-9ca29aa0-de61-43b9-8784-1181580bc6b2}}", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-e3cb5699-1201-4394-bc94-1b58b040b00f", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-db27d521-bdb2-4e54-93c7-9020aad11998"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "2c50e300723342fd890a082b5b19cbba", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-95fb6b1a-36b8-42fc-a2cb-ee62b2b5b502", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-db27d521-bdb2-4e54-93c7-9020aad11998"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "06551b52bea4471a87591728dfb818ab", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-818b871a-acdf-43e1-b953-009f5415c6e6", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-db27d521-bdb2-4e54-93c7-9020aad11998"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "4ef002bd4c244d74a176d172b6d3094a", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-ad7375b9-b7dd-44a1-a4fa-13a57250e186", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-db27d521-bdb2-4e54-93c7-9020aad11998"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "fae4a56e0fba4243a08497fe47b6fb10", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-481f3f24-ef6e-48c3-8a2f-69e12633a7f1", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-db27