]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975680.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-42638712-990a-4440-a53e-676988146743", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-07ef451a-1678-4e8b-92be-fcb9785b8d54"], "event_relative_time": 2.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "RentAFlat", "function": "remove_saved_apartment", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "apartment_id", "value": "a6b069d7531847e4ab2d641e1fa9bb60", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}], "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "gaia2_official_actions", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "time", "level": "unknown", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 646, "wc_served": [1.0], "wc_mean": 1.0, "wc_active": 0, "wc_n": 1, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "3dad207e", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "meta", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "3aa73f4d0bd6", "prof_total_s": 3804.45, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 3804.45, "prof_tok_in": 1042573, "prof_tok_out": 89091, "prof_llm_calls": 40}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T13:25:15.419781", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_60zi6g", "task_desc": "Send emails to each of my friends that are participants in the \"A Conversation Across Cultures\" on Chats. Ask them if they are available for dinner this Friday at 10:00pm. Tell me when you have sent these emails and who they were sent to, and nothing else.\nExactly 2 minutes after you have notified me, if 2 or more respond that they can attend, add a 2 hour \"Dinner with Friends\" event to my calendar for this Friday at 10:00PM at the Uppsala Castle, book a Premium cab ride from my home to the addr", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: Send emails to each of my friends that are participants in the \"A Conversation Across Cultures\" on Chats. Ask them if they are available for dinner th\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll start by finding the \"A Conversation Across Cultures\" conversation on Chats to identify the participants.\nI found the conversation. Let me identify the par\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> ", "response": "I'll start by finding the \"A Conversation Across Cultures\" conversation on Chats to identify the participants.\nI found the conversation. Let me identify the participants by looking up the user IDs and the current user.\nThe current user is Astrid Lundqvist. The friends (participants other than Astrid) are Khalid Ma, Luísa Sousa, and Lianying Wang. Let me find their email addresses in contacts.\nI have all three friends' emails. Now I'll send emails to each asking about dinner this Friday (2024-10-18) at 10:00pm.\nThe recipients need to be a list. Let me retry.\nAll three emails have been sent. Now I'll notify the user as required.\nI've notified the user. Now I need to wait exactly 2 minutes after notifying before checking responses. Let me wait.\n2 minutes have passed. Now let me check the responses from the three friends.\nLet me try a different approach to read the inbox emails.\nI have the responses:\n- **Khalid Ma**: \"Absolutely! Count me in!\" → can attend\n- **Luísa Sousa**: \"Sorry Astrid, I won't be able to make it...\" → can't come\n- **Lianying Wang**: \"Yes! I'd love to catch up.\" → can attend\n\n2 or more can attend, so I'll proceed. Let me add the calendar event and book the Premium cab (30 min prior to 10:00pm = 9:30pm).\nThe cab is booked. The calendar event failed due to the 24:00:00 end time. Let me fix it.\nCalendar event added. Now let me send email replies to the two friends who can attend (Khalid and Lianying) with the address and my excitement. Luísa can't come, so no email to her.\nAll actions are complete. Let me summarize what was done.\n\nI have completed the task. Here is the summary:\n\n**Initial emails sent (to all 3 participants of \"A Conversation Across Cultures\"):**\n- Khalid Ma (khalid.ma@xianmosque.org)\n- Luísa Sousa (luisasousa@gaia2mail.com)\n- Lianying Wang (lianyingwang@gaia2mail.com)\n\n**Responses received (2+ can attend):**\n- Khalid Ma: \"Absolutely! Count me in!\" ✓\n- Lianying Wang: \"Yes! I'd love to catch up.\" ✓\n- Luísa Sousa: \"Sorry Astrid, I won't be able to make it.\" ✗ (no email sent)\n\n**Follow-up actions taken:**\n- Added \"Dinner with Friends\" calendar event: Friday 2024-10-18, 10:00pm–12:00am, at Uppsala Castle, 753 30 Uppsala\n- Booked a Premium cab from my home to Uppsala Castle, 753 30 Uppsala, for 9:30pm (30 min prior)\n- Sent email replies to Khalid and Lianying with the address and my excitement to see them soon (Luísa was not emailed since she can't attend)\nNo new follow-up message arrived. The task has been fully completed:\n\n- **Initial dinner-invitation emails** were sent to all 3 participants of \"A Conversation Across Cultures\": Khalid Ma, Luísa Sousa, and Lianying Wang.\n- **Responses:** Khalid and Lianying confirmed they can attend (2+), while Luísa said she can't come.\n- **Follow-up actions completed:** Added the \"Dinner with Friends\" calendar event (Fri 2024-10-18, 10:00pm–12:00am at Uppsala Castle, 753 30 Uppsala), booked a Premium cab from home to Uppsala Castle for 9:30pm, and sent email replies to Khalid and Lianying with the address and my excitement (Luísa was not emailed since she can't attend).\n\nThe task is done.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-81db1915-035d-4871-a6f4-c5c3b7f8016b", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-9c1f9215-5ce4-47cb-8213-bd7c86df068f"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"khalid.ma@xianmosque.org\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "Dinner this Friday?", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Hi Khalid, are you available for dinner this Friday at 10:00pm?", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-4c46c9ec-3738-47ad-80ca-0c4c3c56bd5c", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-9c1f9215-5ce4-47cb-8213-bd7c86df068f"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"lianyingwang@gaia2mail.com\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "Dinner this Friday?", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Hi Lianying, \n\nAre you available for dinner this Friday at 10:00pm?\n\nBest,\n\nAstrid", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "valu