{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T13:27:10.145216", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_kgqyjr", "task_desc": "Send Åsa Lindström an email with the subject \"Flat Viewing\" which contains the names of all the Malmö properties in my saved list and tell her I’ll help her view them at 2pm this Sunday. On the same day, book a default cab to collect me from my home at 1:30pm to take me to the location of the Malmö Majestic property. Let me know when the cab is booked and Åsa Lindström has been emailed. \n\nIf Åsa Lindström sends an email mentioning an alternative date and time to view properties, cancel all event", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: Send Åsa Lindström an email with the subject \"Flat Viewing\" which contains the names of all the Malmö properties in my saved list and tell her I’ll he\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll start by gathering the information I need: my saved apartments, my home location, and Åsa Lindström's contact details.\nI have Åsa's email. Now I need the f\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> ", "response": "I'll start by gathering the information I need: my saved apartments, Åsa Lindström's contact details, my home location, and the Malmö Majestic property location.\nI have Åsa's email. Now I need to find all Malmö properties in my saved list and the Malmö Majestic property location. Let me search specifically.\nI found Malmö Majestic at \"Malmöhusvägen 34, Malmö\". Now I need the complete saved list to identify all Malmö properties. The previous result was truncated. Let me get the full saved list.\nThe saved list is being truncated in display. Let me search for saved Malmö apartments using the proper boolean parameter, and also check the full saved list by searching with saved_only.\nThe saved_only parameter has a type issue. Let me search all Malmö apartments to identify which are saved, and get the full apartment catalog.\nI need the complete picture of Malmö saved properties. The search results are truncated. Let me get the full apartment catalog and check Malmö Central's saved status.\nI need the complete saved list to ensure I capture all Malmö properties. The display is truncating. Let me try the saved_only filter with a proper boolean value, and also re-check the Malmö search to confirm completeness.\nThe Malmö search result was truncated, and I know Malmö Majestic (saved) wasn't shown. I need the complete set of Malmö properties to identify all saved ones. Let me search by Malmö zip codes to get focused, complete results.\nI now have a complete picture. The Malmö properties in my saved list are:\n- **Malmö Marina** (saved)\n- **Malmö Majestic** (saved)\n- **Malmö Modern** (saved)\n\n(Malmö Castle, Central, Öster, Möllan, Östra are not saved.)\n\nToday is Tuesday 2024-10-15, so this Sunday is **2024-10-20**. My home is \"Östermalmsgatan 12, 114 39 Stockholm, Sweden\" and Malmö Majestic is at \"Malmöhusvägen 34, Malmö\".\n\nLet me send the email to Åsa and book the default cab for Sunday 1:30pm.\nThe cab is booked (ride_id: 4e3d1297833d3aa85facd3dd11a81ea4). The email failed because recipients must be a list. Let me retry.\nThe email is sent and Åsa has already replied with emails. Let me read them to find her proposed alternative date and time.\nÅsa's relevant email says: \"I can't make it on Sunday. I can do the following Wednesday the 23rd at 2pm till 5pm.\" So her proposed time is **Wednesday, October 23, 2pm–5pm**. The other two emails (cookies, old photos) are unrelated — I'll ignore them.\n\nNow let me find calendar events that conflict/overlap with Oct 23, 2pm–5pm, and cancel the cab.\nThe cab is cancelled. On Oct 23, only the **\"Coffee Break with Linnea\"** (14:00–15:00) overlaps with Åsa's proposed 2pm–5pm window. The other two events (Social Media Management 09:00–11:00, Self-Care 20:00–21:00) do not overlap.\n\nLet me cancel the conflicting event.\nThe conflicting event is cancelled. Now I need to: (1) notify the attendee (Linnea Åström) via Chats, (2) add the \"Viewing Flats\" event on Oct 23 2pm–5pm, and (3) re-book the cab for 1:30pm Oct 23. Let me find Linnea's Chats user ID and add the calendar event in parallel.\nI have Linnea's Chats ID and the \"Viewing Flats\" event is added. Now let me send the cancellation message to Linnea on Chats and re-book the cab for 1:30pm Oct 23 (half an hour before the new 2pm time).\nAll tasks are complete. Let me provide a summary to the user.\nAll tasks have been completed successfully. Here's what was accomplished:\n\n**Initial setup (Sunday, Oct 20):**\n- Emailed Åsa Lindström with subject \"Flat Viewing\" listing the three Malmö saved properties (Malmö Marina, Malmö Majestic, Malmö Modern) and offering to help her view them at 2pm Sunday.\n- Booked a default cab from home to Malmö Majestic for 1:30pm Sunday.\n\n**After Åsa proposed Wednesday, Oct 23, 2pm–5pm:**\n- Cancelled the conflicting \"Coffee Break with Linnea\" event (2–3pm Oct 23); the non-overlapping events were left alone.\n- Cancelled the original Sunday cab.\n- Messaged Linnea Åström on Chats about the cancellation.\n- Added a \"Viewing Flats\" calendar event for Oct 23, 2–5pm.\n- Re-booked the default cab for 1:30pm Oct 23 (half an hour before the new time).\n\nThe cab is booked and Åsa has been emailed.\nNo new follow-up message arrived within the wait window. The task has been fully completed as described in my summary:\n\n- **Email to Åsa Lindström** (\"Flat Viewing\") sent with the three Malmö saved properties (Malmö Marina, Malmö Majestic, Malmö Modern) and the Sunday 2pm offer.\n- **Original Sunday cab** booked, then cancelled after Åsa proposed a new time.\n- **Åsa's alternative (Wed Oct 23, 2–5pm)** handled: cancelled the conflicting \"Coffee Break with Linnea\" event, notified Linnea via Chats, added the \"Viewing Flats\" calendar event, and re-booked the cab for 1:30pm Oct 23.\n- Unrelated emails (cookies, old Stockholm photos) were ignored.\n\nEverything is done — no further action needed.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-54555ece-7ce3-4a23-b640-5cbcbf78c705", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-c35d3482-9849-499d-8cc2-adc4fd9d3c55"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Cabs", "function": "order_ride", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "start_location", "value": "Home", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "end_location", "value": "Malmöhusvägen 34, Malmö", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "service_type", "value": "Default", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "ride_time", "value": "2024-10-20 13:30:00", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-dd69e374-1d9a-4210-81d6-078b7190f6ca", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-c35d3482-9849-499d-8cc2-adc4fd9d3c55"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"asa.lindstrom@gaia2mail.com\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "Flat Viewing", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Dear Åsa,\n\nI'll help you view the following Malmö properties at 2pm this Sunday:\n\n* Malmö Modern\n* Malmö Marina\n* Malmö Castle Views\n* Malmö Majestic\n* Malmö Marina View\n* Malmö Harbour\n* Malmö City Center\n\nBest,\nAstrid", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-957c6542-f931-4dbe-819d-f8a41cad6fa7", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AG