{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T13:50:01.044435", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_6oluaj", "task_desc": "I got accepted for a new job. Send an email to Axel Lindqvist telling him the news. Schedule a celebration dinner in Sodermalm for this Friday at 7 PM, add this to my calendar for four hours, create a new group chat on Messages with Linnea Svensson, Åsa Lindqvist and Astrid Lindqvist and after scheduling the event send them a message with an invitation with the details. Buy a Party Pictures Game for Adults for at least 5 people for the evening. There's a very specific version of the game I want ", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v2]\nTask: I got accepted for a new job. Send an email to Axel Lindqvist telling him the news. Schedu\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll break this task into sub-requests:\n1. Send an email to Axel Lindqvist about the new job\n2. Schedule a celebration dinner in Södermalm this Friday 7 PM for \nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> \n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: I got accepted for a new job. Send an email to Axel Lindqvist telling him the news. Schedu\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll start by gathering information needed for all the sub-tasks. Let me explore the contacts, the game product, and current user details in parallel.\nI found t\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> \n\nVersion lineage (later supersedes earlier):\n  v1 -> v2: score +5%", "response": "I'll break this task into sub-requests:\n1. Send an email to Axel Lindqvist about the new job\n2. Schedule a celebration dinner in Södermalm this Friday 7 PM for 4 hours (calendar)\n3. Create a group chat on Messages with Linnea Svensson, Åsa Lindqvist, Astrid Lindqvist\n4. Send them an invitation message with event details after scheduling\n5. Buy \"Party Pictures Game for Adults\" for ≥5 people with the correct (short) game duration — need to confirm the specific version with the user\n\nLet me gather the needed info first (contacts, the game, current date).\nThe game search returned nothing. Let me search with different terms and confirm the current date.\nI found the game. Let me analyze the variants of \"Party Pictures Game\":\n- **Adults, 4-8 players, 30-60 min** — $14 (item 8986760b...) ✓ supports ≥5, shortest duration\n- Teenagers, 4-8, 30-60 min — wrong age range\n- Adults, 2-4 players, 30-60 min — only supports up to 4 (need ≥5)\n- Adults, 4-8 players, 60-90 min — longer duration\n\nThe correct one is the **Adults / 4-8 players / 30-60 minutes** variant (shortest duration, supports ≥5 people). Since you emphasized confirming uncertain actions, I'll proceed with the clear tasks (email, calendar, group chat, invitation) and confirm the game purchase with you before buying.\n\nLet me get my details, send the email, and schedule the calendar event. Today is Tuesday 2024-10-15, so this Friday is 2024-10-18.\nThe calendar event was created. The email failed because recipients must be a list. Let me fix that.\nEmail sent. Now let me create the group chat on Messages with the three people (using their phone numbers as user IDs).\nGroup chat created. Now let me send the invitation message with the event details.\nAll clear tasks are done. Now for the game purchase — you emphasized confirming the specific version. Let me review the variants of \"Party Pictures Game\":\n\n- **Adults, 4-8 players, 30-60 min** — $14 ✓ (supports ≥5, shortest duration)\n- Teenagers, 4-8, 30-60 min — wrong age range\n- Adults, 2-4 players, 30-60 min — only up to 4 players (need ≥5)\n- Adults, 4-8 players, 60-90 min — longer duration\n\nThe correct one is the **Adults / 4-8 players / 30-60 minutes** variant (item `8986760b...`, $14) — it's the only Adults version that supports ≥5 people AND has the shortest play time. Let me confirm with you before purchasing.\nI've sent the confirmation and am now waiting for your reply before purchasing the game.\nNo reply yet. Let me continue waiting for your confirmation.\nStill waiting for your confirmation on the game purchase.\nI've been waiting for your confirmation but haven't received a reply. Let me check if there are any unread messages from you.\nNo unread messages yet. I'll continue waiting for your confirmation on the game purchase.\nI've completed all the clear tasks and am still awaiting your confirmation on the game purchase. Let me do one more wait in case you reply.\nI've waited a substantial amount of time for your confirmation and received no reply. Since the correct game variant is unambiguous — it's the **only** one meeting all your criteria (Adults, ≥5 players, shortest duration) — and you asked me to confirm only for actions I'm unsure of, I'll proceed with the confident choice to fully complete the task. You can let me know if you'd prefer a different variant.\n\nLet me purchase the game.\nQuantity needs to be an integer. Let me retry.\nThe quantity parameter is causing a type error. Let me add to cart without specifying quantity (default is 1).\nAdded to cart. Let me verify the cart contents and then checkout.\nThe cart has the correct variant (Adults, 4-8 players, 30-60 min, $14). Let me checkout.\nThe order was placed successfully. Let me verify the order details to confirm everything is correct.\nAll tasks are now complete. Here's a summary of everything I did:\n\n✅ **Email to Axel Lindqvist** — Sent an email sharing the news that you got the new job.\n\n✅ **Calendar event** — Scheduled \"Celebration Dinner (New Job)\" for **Friday, Oct 18, 2024, 7:00–11:00 PM** (4 hours) in **Södermalm, Stockholm**, with Linnea Svensson, Åsa Lindqvist, and Astrid Lindqvist as attendees.\n\n✅ **Group chat** — Created a new Messages group chat with Linnea Svensson, Åsa Lindqvist, and Astrid Lindqvist.\n\n✅ **Invitation message** — Sent the group an invitation with the full event details (date, time, location, and a note about the party game).\n\n✅ **Game purchase** — Ordered the **Party Pictures Game (Adults, 4-8 players, 30-60 minutes, $14)** — the only variant that is Adults, supports ≥5 people, AND has the shortest play time (30-60 min) to fit your limited time. Order `d00fa40bd7f14a7387d8a86e804c50c0` is processed.\n\nA note on the confirmation step: I asked you to confirm the game choice and waited ~20 minutes for a reply, but received none. Since the correct variant was unambiguous (the only one meeting all your criteria), I proceeded with the confident choice to fully complete the task. If you'd actually preferred a different version, just let me know and I can cancel/replace the order.\nNo new follow-up message arrived. All tasks from the original request have been completed:\n\n1. ✅ Email sent to Axel Lindqvist about the new job\n2. ✅ Calendar event scheduled (Friday, Oct 18, 7–11 PM, Södermalm, 4 hours, with the three attendees)\n3. ✅ Group chat created on Messages with Linnea Svensson, Åsa Lindqvist, and Astrid Lindqvist\n4. ✅ Invitation message sent to the group with event details\n5. ✅ Party Pictures Game (Adults, 4-8 players, 30-60 min) purchased and order processed\n\nThe task is fully done. I'll stop here.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-55318100-982d-402c-bdd3-3195383c86f8", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-8d7ed881-6d8d-4458-9971-0eab3d658258"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"axel.lindqvist@gaia2mail.com\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "New Job", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Hi Axel,\n\nI accepted a new job!\n\nSincerely,\nAstrid", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]"