p": "AgentUserInterface", "function": "send_message_to_user", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "content", "value": "The document was sent to 6 contacts.", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}], "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "gaia2_official_actions", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "execution", "level": "unknown", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 646, "wc_served": [1.0, 1.0], "wc_mean": 1.0, "wc_active": 0, "wc_n": 2, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "3dad207e", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "meta", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "3aa73f4d0bd6", "prof_total_s": 4526.83, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 4526.83, "prof_tok_in": 784429, "prof_tok_out": 62822, "prof_llm_calls": 40}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T14:02:44.865656", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_2edv2p", "task_desc": "I dislike the current campaign I'm promoting, so please, delete all events tagged as work in my calendar starting tomorrow through this Saturday, send a message to the most frequent attendee of those events on Chats saying \"Get me out of this deal, fast!\" and email my Swedish marketing manager to let them know I need a new brand deal. If I don't email this person, I might get fired.", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v2]\nTask: I dislike the current campaign I'm promoting, so please, delete all events tagged as work \nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll break this task into sub-requests:\n1. Delete all \"work\"-tagged calendar events from tomorrow (2024-10-16) through Saturday (2024-10-19)\n2. Find the most fr\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> \n\nVersion lineage (later supersedes earlier):\n  v1 -> v2: score -50%", "response": "I'll break this task into sub-requests:\n1. Delete all \"work\"-tagged calendar events from tomorrow (2024-10-16) through Saturday (2024-10-19)\n2. Find the most frequent attendee of those events\n3. Send a Chats message to that attendee: \"Get me out of this deal, fast!\"\n4. Email the Swedish marketing manager about needing a new brand deal\n\nLet me start by inspecting the work-tagged events and confirming the current date.\nThe tag search returned empty. Let me check what tags exist and look at events in the date range directly.\nThe tag search is case-sensitive (returned empty for \"work\" but events show \"Work\"). Let me get all events in the date range with a higher limit to capture every Work-tagged event.\nThe offset/limit parameters need to be integers. Let me try without them, or the default limit may be too small. Let me call without those params first.\nThe result is being truncated in display. Let me query each day separately to get the complete list of events and identify all Work-tagged ones.\nI now have all Work-tagged events from 2024-10-16 through 2024-10-19. Let me identify them:\n\n**Work events:**\n- Wed 10-16: Brand Partnership Meeting (Åke Svensson), Content Creation Session, Social Media Management\n- Thu 10-17: Content Creation Session, Social Media Management, Brand Partnership Meeting (Åke Svensson)\n- Fri 10-18: Content Creation Session\n- Sat 10-19: Brand Partnership Meeting (Åke Svensson)\n\n**Most frequent attendee:** Åke Svensson (appears in 3 events; all others have no attendees).\n\nLet me delete all 8 Work events and look up the contacts I need (Åke Svensson for Chats, and the Swedish marketing manager for email) in parallel.\nAll 8 Work events deleted. Åke Svensson's Chats ID is found. The contacts search for \"marketing manager\" returned nothing — let me search differently to find the Swedish marketing manager.\nI found Astrid Svensson — a Swedish Marketing Manager. Let me get her full contact details to confirm and obtain her email.\nAstrid Svensson is the Swedish Marketing Manager (email: astrid.svensson@gaia2mail.com). Now I'll send the Chats message to Åke Svensson and email Astrid.\nThe email recipients parameter needs to be a list. Let me retry the email.\nAll sub-tasks are complete. Let me summarize what was done.\nAll sub-tasks have been completed successfully:\n\n1. **Deleted all Work-tagged events (Oct 16–19):** Removed 8 events — Brand Partnership Meetings, Content Creation Sessions, and Social Media Management blocks across Wednesday through Saturday. Health and Personal events were left untouched.\n\n2. **Sent the Chats message:** The most frequent attendee was **Åke Svensson** (appeared in all 3 Brand Partnership Meetings). I messaged him: \"Get me out of this deal, fast!\"\n\n3. **Emailed your Swedish marketing manager:** Found **Astrid Svensson** (Swedish Marketing Manager in Stockholm) and emailed her at astrid.svensson@gaia2mail.com to let her know you need a new brand deal.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-1b8058da-f492-4cce-8f07-ae3f509859de", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-7762adbb-7467-44f5-a40e-37fc8048269f"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "81141f54d8904d15b58faaff860d0d65", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-e4c15bb6-9a54-4994-8768-8bf38d2e2194", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-7762adbb-7467-44f5-a40e-37fc8048269f"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "7491df4dfb5d4586b3d43c0f4f9e81d5", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-30b93c33-9d08-4160-bd7e-5b7a8fb1db6d", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-7762adbb-7467-44f5-a40e-37fc8048269f"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "15a8031c0f1e4e6c867b93b08a5d365b", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-dd6739cc-2b01-490b-b0dd-baada3656ee6", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-7762adbb-7467-44f5-a40e-37fc8048269f"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type":