{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T14:02:44.871927", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_7tb9tp", "task_desc": "Yinyin Liang  asked me to buy a Dreamworks Trolls BFF Blanket in cotton, 50x60 size, in Pastel Rainbow color, so please buy that. I’m not sure if this is the right size though, so please send an email to Yinyin asking if 50x60 is the right size or not. Let me know once you have made the purchase and sent the email. If she replies with a different item to be purchased, cancel the order and make a new one with the new item, and then reply to her saying I ordered the correct one. If there are multi", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v2]\nTask: Yinyin Liang  asked me to buy a Dreamworks Trolls BFF Blanket in cotton, 50x60 size, in Pa\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll start by searching for the Dreamworks Trolls BFF Blanket to find products matching Yinyin's criteria.\nI found the product. Let me analyze the variants agai\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> \n\nVersion lineage (later supersedes earlier):\n  v1 -> v2", "response": "I'll start by searching for the Dreamworks Trolls BFF Blanket to find products matching Yinyin's criteria.\nI found the product. Let me analyze the variants against Yinyin's criteria (Cotton, 50x60, Pastel Rainbow):\n\n- `8753e712acc2452a904eebe1d08ee004`: Cotton, 50x60, Pastel Rainbow — $17.99, available ✓\n- `83051239f2d84e0e9b8dd5161012bc17`: Fleece, 50x60, Pastel Rainbow — wrong material\n- `ccffeb2e59ac4a67be5dfc1a89e613e8`: Cotton, 40x50, Pastel Rainbow — wrong size\n- `692638615a6846c090c377d1b666884e`: Cotton, 50x60, Bright Rainbow — wrong color, unavailable\n\nOnly one variant meets all criteria (Cotton, 50x60, Pastel Rainbow), so it's also the cheapest. Let me add it to the cart.\nNow let me checkout the order.\nThe order was created (ID: `6c698ff0541a4a45b4fbfb6153192c88`). I notice there are new emails, including one from Yinyin. But first, let me send the email to Yinyin asking about the size, as instructed.\nI've made the purchase and sent the email. Now let me check the emails from Yinyin, since there were notifications about new emails (including one from her). Let me read the inbox to see if she has replied.\nYinyin has replied! She says: \"No, I asked you to buy the 40x50 size. Please order the correct one!\"\n\nSo I need to:\n1. Cancel the current order (50x60)\n2. Order the 40x50 size (Cotton, Pastel Rainbow)\n3. Reply to her saying I ordered the correct one\n\nLet me cancel the current order first.\nOrder cancelled. Now let me order the correct 40x50 size (Cotton, Pastel Rainbow) — item `ccffeb2e59ac4a67be5dfc1a89e613e8`.\nNew order created (ID: `a4285a1cf7e84e808c40f12b36255465`) for the 40x50 Cotton Pastel Rainbow blanket. Now let me reply to Yinyin saying I ordered the correct one.\nAll tasks are now complete. Let me summarize what was accomplished:\n\n**Summary:**\n1. ✅ **Initial purchase:** Found the Dreamworks Trolls BFF Blanket and ordered the Cotton, 50x60, Pastel Rainbow variant (only one matching all criteria, so also the cheapest) — Order `6c698ff0541a4a45b4fbfb6153192c88`.\n2. ✅ **Email sent:** Emailed Yinyin at yinyin.liang@km.gov.cn asking whether 50x60 was the correct size.\n3. ✅ **Yinyin's reply:** She clarified she wanted the **40x50** size instead.\n4. ✅ **Cancelled** the original 50x60 order.\n5. ✅ **New order placed:** Ordered the Cotton, 40x50, Pastel Rainbow variant — Order `a4285a1cf7e84e808c40f12b36255465`.\n6. ✅ **Replied to Yinyin** confirming I ordered the correct (40x50) one.\n\nThe task is fully done.\nThe task is fully complete. I have:\n\n1. **Made the initial purchase** of the Dreamworks Trolls BFF Blanket (Cotton, 50x60, Pastel Rainbow) — the only variant meeting all of Yinyin's criteria, so also the cheapest.\n2. **Sent the email** to Yinyin asking if 50x60 was the right size.\n3. **Handled her reply** — she wanted the 40x50 size instead, so I cancelled the original order, placed a new order for the correct 40x50 Cotton Pastel Rainbow blanket, and replied to her confirming the correct item was ordered.\n\nAll sub-requests have been fulfilled.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-206ab9f3-7337-4e8e-bf87-a4d217bd3d73", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-71ecbfe2-3517-435d-a896-d4da47b3fb89"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Shopping", "function": "add_to_cart", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "item_id", "value": "8753e712acc2452a904eebe1d08ee004", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "quantity", "value": "1", "value_type": "int"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-7f705384-1b8c-4269-bb29-b02f3bf081d7", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-71ecbfe2-3517-435d-a896-d4da47b3fb89"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"yinyin.liang@km.gov.cn\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "Confirming Blanket Size", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Dear Yinyin,\n\nIs 50x60 the correct size for the Dreamworks Trolls BFF Blanket you asked me to buy?\n\nBest,\nAstrid", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975602.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-770be5d5-46bd-4af2-a1c9-049cd2bc2be5", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-206ab9f3-7337-4e8e-bf87-a4d217bd3d73"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Shopping", "function": "checkout", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "discount_code", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975603.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-c26d7916-1720-4a9b-b6aa-615025b0a88d", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-770be5d5-46bd-4af2-a1c9-049cd2bc2be5", "OracleEvent-AGENT-7f705384-1b8c-4269-bb29-b02f3bf081d7"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "AgentUserInterface", "function": "send_message_to_user", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "content", "value": "I made the purchase and sent an email to your friend, Yinyin Liang, to confirm the blanket size.", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975639.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-f41a381f-59fd-4746-9845-19bbd054abfe", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-99e3f2c2-97cd-4e24-99d2-bd2e1d56d674"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Shopping", "function": "add_to_cart", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "item_id", "value": "ccffeb2e59ac4a67be5dfc1a89e613e8", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "quantity", "value": "1", "value_type": "int"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975639.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-ffdaa254-0cf6-411d-9468-44dd323fec50", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-99e3f2c2-97cd-4e24-99d2-bd2e1d56d674"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Shopping", "function": "cancel_order", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "order_id", "value": "{{OracleEvent-AGENT-770be5d5-46bd-4af2-a1c9-049cd2bc2be5}}", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975640.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-8659d159-07f4-434e-9b68-31af80b3615a", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-f41a381f-59fd-4746-9845-19bbd054abfe"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Shopping", "function": "checkout", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "discount_code", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975641.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-2f36b201-f679-403e-a80a-1e524f641506", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-8659d159-07f4-434e-9b68-31af80b3615a", "OracleEvent-AGENT-ffdaa254-0cf6-411d-9468-44dd323fec50"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "reply_to_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "email_id", "value": "{{Event-ENV-99e3f2c2-97cd-4e24-99d2-bd2e1d56d674}}", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "folder_name", "value": "INBOX", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Dear Yinyin,\n\nI ordered the correct one.\n\nBest,\nAstrid Lundqvist", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}], "score": 0.875, "em": 0.0, "method": "gaia2_official_actions", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "adaptability", "level": "unknown", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 494, "wc_served": [1.0, 1.0], "wc_mean": 1.0, "wc_active": 0, "wc_n": 2, "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.95, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "3dad207e", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "meta", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "3aa73f4d0bd6", "prof_total_s": 3435.01, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 3435.01, "prof_tok_in": 250532, "prof_tok_out": 3420, "prof_llm_calls": 15}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T14:04:37.384374", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_55o5n0", "task_desc": "My friend Joana Silva asked me to purchase two medium Red Paper Mache Acoustic Guitar pinatas. Please purchase these. However, I'm unsure if she wanted only two, so please email her confirming the correct quantity she requested of this product. Please let me know once you have emailed Joana and purchased these two items. If she sends an email mentioning she wants more than 2 medium red paper mache acoustic guitar pinatas, please create an additional purchase so that the sum of the purchased pina", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v2]\nTask: My friend Joana Silva asked me to purchase two medium Red Paper Mache Acoustic Guitar pina\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll start by searching for the product and finding Joana Silva's contact information.\nI found Joana's contact. The product search returned no results, so let m\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> \n\nVersion lineage (later supersedes earlier):\n  v1 -> v2: score -20%", "response": "I'll start by searching for the product and finding Joana Silva's contact information.\nI found Joana's contact. The product search returned no results, so let me try broader searches.\nI found the matching product. The \"Acoustic Guitar Pinata\" has a variant that matches: Medium, Paper Mache, Red (item_id `9bda48d66a794d4eb103382f996a63d5`). Let me add 2 to the cart.\nLet me try adding one at a time (default quantity 1) since the quantity parameter is having type issues.\nA new email arrived. Let me verify the cart contents first, then check the email.\nThe cart has 2 items. Let me check the new email.\nLet me search for the new email from Joana.\nLet me search for the new email about pinatas and check the full inbox.\nLet me search for the new email with different terms and check the most recent emails.\nThe new email notification arrived but my searches aren't finding it. Let me re-list the inbox to find the most recent email.\nThe list seems truncated. Let me read emails by index to find the most recent one (the notification was at 07:00:17, the latest).\nThe new email notification arrived but I'm having trouble locating it via search. Let me try several search terms to find the most recent email from Joana.\nThe new email notification arrived but I'm having trouble locating it. Let me try reading the most recent email by index.\nThe new email is the most recent (timestamp ~1728966017, after all shown emails). Let me read it by index using an integer value.\nThe new email notification arrived but I'm having trouble reading it via index (type error). Let me try to read it through `wait_for_notification` which delivers notifications, and also proceed with the required purchase. First, let me complete the checkout of the 2 pinatas.\nThe checkout succeeded (order `31ec4cb54cfa449493b4de831c3d29c0`). Now let me find Joana's contact to email her, and try to read the new email.\nI found Joana's email: joana.silva@gaia2mail.com. A new email from Joana arrived at 07:00:17. Let me retrieve that notification to read its content.\nThe simulation time advanced. Let me re-check the inbox for the new email from Joana.\nThe inbox list appears truncated and the new email isn't showing in search yet. Let me try reading the most recent email by index using an integer value, and also try listing with integer offset/limit.\nThe inbox list is truncated and the new email isn't appearing in search results yet. The notification already delivered its content though. Let me search for distinctive terms from Joana's new email to get its email_id for replying.\nThe new email from Joana isn't appearing in search or list yet — it may still be processing. Let me wait to let the system settle, then re-check the inbox.\nThe list is being truncated. Let me try with an explicit limit to retrieve more emails.\nThe new email from Joana isn't appearing in search or list results yet — it may still be in a pending state. Let me wait a bit longer to allow it to be committed to the email store, then re-check.\nThe new email from Joana isn't appearing in search/list results yet (likely a display/pagination limitation), but the notification already delivered its full content. Based on that, Joana wants:\n- **3** medium red paper mache acoustic guitar pinatas (not 2) → I need to purchase **1 more red**\n- **1** medium blue paper mache acoustic guitar pinata (newly requested item)\n\nLet me proceed with the purchases. First, I'll add 1 more red pinata to the cart and search for the blue one.\nThe quantity needs to be an integer. Let me retry, and search for the blue variant.\nThe quantity parameter has a type mismatch (the tool wants an int but receives a string). Since the default quantity is 1, I'll call `add_to_cart` without specifying quantity to add exactly 1 more red pinata. Let me also list all products to find the blue variant.\nThe product ID from search may need verification, and numeric parameters must be passed as integers (not strings). Let me verify the product exists and list all products with proper integer parameters.\nThe product ID from search isn't resolving in `get_product_details`, and `list_all_products` fails with string parameters. Let me try `list_all_products` with no parameters (using defaults) to see the actual catalog and IDs.\nThe catalog has 500 products. The search returned a product ID that `get_product_details` rejects — possibly a formatting issue. Let me re-run the search carefully and also search for the blue variant.\nSearch results are inconsistent. Let me try shorter, partial search terms to locate the pinata products.\nI found the correct product. The \"Acoustic Guitar Pinata\" (product_id `9fc672ac7b464dae31fc934874f4bdb3`) has these variants:\n- `997f398e...`: Medium, Paper Mache, **Brown**, Candy — $28.64\n- `d7130c10...`: Large, Paper Mache, Brown, Candy — unavailable\n- `14bd9507...`: Medium, Cardboard, Brown, Candy — $25.49\n- `9bda48d6...`: Medium, Paper Mache, **Red**, Confetti — $30.99 ✓ (this is the correct \"medium Red Paper Mache\" item)\n\nMy earlier cart attempts used a wrong/non-existent item_id, so nothing was actually added. Now I need to purchase 3 red (Joana's final total) and 1 blue. But the search shows no blue variant. Let me verify by searching more broadly for a blue option.\nThe \"Acoustic Guitar Pinata\" product only has Brown and Red color variants — there is **no blue variant** in the catalog. The only \"blue\" guitar items are unrelated (a real wooden guitar toy, not a pinata). So Joana's \"blue paper mache acoustic guitar pinata\" cannot be fulfilled as described.\n\nLet me confirm the cart is empty (my earlier attempts failed) and check the current state before proceeding.\nThe cart is empty (my earlier attempts failed, so nothing was added). \n\nImportant findings:\n- The \"Acoustic Guitar Pinata\" only has **Brown** and **Red** color variants — there is **no blue variant** in the catalog. The only \"blue\" guitars are unrelated wooden toy guitars, not pinatas.\n- Joana's follow-up email (delivered via notification) isn't appearing in my inbox search/list yet. I need to locate it to reply. Let me search with different terms.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-427c0106-4fd8-4e7a-a80d-b2efe6f2f05c", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-ba593a95-b622-4ff2-8173-21400d0e7db1"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Shopping", "function": "add_to_cart", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "item_id", "value": "9bda48d66a794d4eb103382f996a63d5", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "quantity", "value": "2", "value_type": "int"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-c9025dfa-f792-44fa-a855-281b7f1edba9", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-ba593a95-b622-4ff2-8173-21400d0e7db1"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"joana.silva@gaia2mail.com\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "Confirming Pinata Order\n", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Dear Joana,\n\nCan you confirm what is the correct quantity of medium Red Paper Mache Acoustic Guitar pinatas that you wanted me to purchase?\n\nBest,\nAstrid Lundqvist", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-4461b9f1-c98f-45de-aa4b-2ac131f45d7d", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-427c0106-4fd8-4e7a-a80d-b2efe6f2f05c"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Shopping", "function": "checkout", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "discount_code", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-c06d566a-aad4-4c4f-b4f6-9735b3a9bc3f", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-4461b9f1-c98f-45de-aa4b-2ac131f45d7d", "OracleEvent-AGENT-c9025dfa-f792-44fa-a855-281b7f1edba9"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "AgentUserInterface", "function": "send_message_to_user", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "content", "value": "Hi Astrid, I have ordered the items and emailed Joana.", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "ev