": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Hi Joana, The 5 Medium Red Paper Mache Acoustic Guitar pinatas and 1 of the most expensive candy filling pinatas have been ordered.\nBest,\nAstrid Lundqvist", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}], "score": 0.375, "em": 0.0, "method": "gaia2_official_actions", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "adaptability", "level": "unknown", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 654, "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "3dad207e", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "meta", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "3aa73f4d0bd6", "prof_total_s": 3840.7, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 3840.7, "prof_tok_in": 746877, "prof_tok_out": 30599, "prof_llm_calls": 40}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T14:05:20.070837", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_ycoch2", "task_desc": "Create a group convo on Chats with my friends Åsa Lundgren, Linnea Åström, Lianhua Wei, Søren Jensen, and Akira Lundström. Set the title as \"Happy Astrid Day!\". Let me know once you've created the group conversation. As soon as 3 or more different people send a message to the group conversation within the next 5 minutes from now, schedule a van ride from home to the club at Tegnérgatan 8, 111 40 Stockholm, at 9:30pm, and send a message to the conversation telling them to meet at my place at 8pm,", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v2]\nTask: Create a group convo on Chats with my friends Åsa Lundgren, Linnea Åström, Lianhua Wei, Sø\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll start by gathering the user IDs for each friend and the current user's details. Let me look these up in parallel.\nI have all the user IDs. Now let me creat\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> \n\n[Prior attempt — store version v1]\nTask: Create a group convo on Chats with my friends Åsa Lundgren, Linnea Åström, Lianhua Wei, Sø\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll start by looking up the user IDs for each of the friends so I can create the group conversation.\nI have all the user IDs. Now let me create the group conve\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> \n\nVersion lineage (later supersedes earlier):\n  v1 -> v2: score -40%", "response": "I'll start by gathering the user IDs for each friend and the current user's details. Let me look these up in parallel.\nI have all the user IDs. Now let me create the group conversation with the title \"Happy Astrid Day!\".\nThe group conversation has been created successfully (ID: `0f8cf3bb3c45ae8fc3ae97d6ad0378d8`). \n\nNow I need to monitor for messages from the friends within the next 5 minutes. Let me wait for notifications from the environment.\nThe notifications reference other conversation IDs, not my group conversation. Let me check my group conversation directly to see if any of the friends have messaged.\nLet me try with proper integer types.\nLet me try calling without the offset/limit parameters.\nThe group conversation still has 0 messages. The notifications I received were for other conversation IDs, not my group conversation. Let me verify the current time to confirm the 5-minute window has elapsed.\nThe 5-minute window has now elapsed (current sim time is ~07:06, and the window was 07:00–07:05). Let me do a final verification of the group conversation to confirm whether any of the friends messaged.\nThe group conversation is created and the 5-minute monitoring window has elapsed. No messages were received from the friends in the group conversation, so the conditional actions (van ride, meet-up message, calendar cleanup) were not triggered.\n\nLet me inform the user.\nI've completed the task. Here's a summary of what was done:\n\n**✅ Completed:**\n- Created the group conversation **\"Happy Astrid Day!\"** on Chats with all five friends: Åsa Lundgren, Linnea Åström, Lianhua Wei, Søren Jensen, and Akira Lundström (conversation ID: `0f8cf3bb3c45ae8fc3ae97d6ad0378d8`).\n- Monitored the conversation for the full 5-minute window (07:00–07:06) for incoming messages.\n\n**⏸️ Conditional actions not triggered:**\n- The condition required **3 or more different people** to send a message to the group within 5 minutes. The conversation received **0 messages** from your friends during that window, so I did **not** schedule the van ride, send the \"meet at my place at 8pm\" message, or delete tonight's calendar events.\n\nIf your friends begin messaging the group later and you'd like me to carry out the van ride, meet-up message, and calendar cleanup, just say the word!", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-f6183e0a-84cc-4199-90c8-87b97c027a80", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-d30e9c61-85d1-425b-8cca-6a7bfcb73ff0"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Chats", "function": "create_group_conversation", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "user_ids", "value": "[\"ca0caf63-6f4f-43c7-8c69-227d7f94b0b5\",\"e5e6fd26-a78e-4c9e-92d3-20ec3444b4d0\",\"12aa065a-82fd-4e30-83a8-0728c2a35b94\",\"986089d3-c119-4f57-a2bc-d7d7fb84eb39\",\"b6f1ec1a-01b4-4e41-b31a-b3d7a87ecde0\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "title", "value": "Happy Astrid Day!", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-25e9c1f2-f58c-49c1-90e1-b0619093481d", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-f6183e0a-84cc-4199-90c8-87b97c027a80"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "AgentUserInterface", "function": "send_message_to_user", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "content", "value": "The group conversation \"Happy Astrid Day!\" has been created.", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-150691c0-9656-4546-9277-6d847bf041b6", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-807372ed-8ed5-4798-92bd-3270f1a5a1f5", "Event-ENV-a51c54a1-6fb3-432c-86de-7638145ef7c0", "Event-ENV-cc1182a8-160e-48cc-b64a-3615b77fd44f"], "event_relative_time": 2.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Cabs", "function": "order_ride", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "start_location", "value": "Home", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "end_location", "value": "Tegnérgatan 8, 111 40 Stockholm", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "service_type", "value": "Van", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "ride_time", "value": "2024-10-15 21:30:00", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-839ea4a4-45e2-420d-a39e-2e9a4dcf3084", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-807372ed-8ed5-4798-92bd-3270f1a5a1f5", "Event-ENV-a51c54a1-6fb3-432c-86de-7638145ef7c0", "Event-ENV-cc1182a8-160e-48cc-b64a-3615b77fd44f"], "event_relative_time": 2.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Chats", "function": "send_message_to_group_conversation", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "conversation_id", "value": "{{OracleEvent-AGENT-f6183e0a-84cc-4199-90c8-87b97c027a80}}", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Hey everyone! Meet at my place at 8pm, we're going out tonight!", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "attachment_path", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-c1afa88f-379b-403c-aea5-0d5fca91aac1", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-807372ed-8ed5-4798-92bd-3270f1a5a1f5", "Event-ENV-a51c54a1-6fb3-432c-86de-7638145ef7c0", "Event-ENV-cc1182a8-160e-48cc-b64a-3615b77fd44f"], "event_relative_time": 2.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "9daa4008ccb14c48a7fd156b953b5c3a", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}], "score": 0.4, "em": 0.0, "method": "gaia2_official_actions", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "time", "level": "unknown", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 927, "wc_served": [1.0], "wc_mean": 1.0, "wc_active": 0, "wc_n": 1, "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.2, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "3dad207e", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "meta", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "3aa73f4d0bd6", "prof_total_s": 3647.97, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 3647.97, "prof_tok_in": 180123,