{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T14:05:20.073964", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_gjw61a", "task_desc": "Schedule a Property Tour event at the most expensive 4 bedroom property in my saved list for this Saturday from 4pm - 5pm. Add the participants of the the most recently updated Messages conversation 'Catching up with friends' as attendees (besides me). Book me a premium cab from Stora Södergatan 25, Lund to the property location (including the zip code) one hour before the property tour starts. Send each of the attendees separate Messages messages with the time and place of the tour. If a new fu", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v2]\nTask: Schedule a Property Tour event at the most expensive 4 bedroom property in my saved list f\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll break this task into sub-tasks and start gathering information. Let me begin with several independent lookups.\nI found saved apartments but the list was tr\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> \n\nVersion lineage (later supersedes earlier):\n  v1 -> v2", "response": "I'll break this task into sub-tasks:\n1. Find the most expensive 4-bedroom property in my saved list\n2. Schedule a Property Tour event this Saturday 4-5pm at that property\n3. Find participants of the most recently updated 'Catching up with friends' Messages conversation\n4. Add them as attendees\n5. Book a premium cab 1 hour before (3pm) from Stora Södergatan 25, Lund to the property\n6. Send each attendee a separate message with time/place\n7. Monitor 3 minutes for a new furnished 4-bedroom property in same zip code that's more expensive; if found, move everything and notify attendees\n\nLet me start by gathering the saved apartments and the conversation info.\nThe saved apartments list was truncated. Let me search specifically for 4-bedroom saved apartments, and also investigate the conversations. The search returned 11 conversation IDs matching \"Catching up with friends\" — I need to find the one with that exact title and most recently updated.\nThe arguments need to be integers. Let me retry.\nThe tool requires integer types. Let me try passing the values as plain numbers.\nThe type errors are a harness quirk with int parameters. Let me work around them: use `search_apartments` with only the string `saved_only` filter, and read the candidate conversations by ID to find the right \"Catching up with friends\" one.\nThe search matched on content (\"catching up\" appears in messages), not necessarily the title. I need to find the conversation with the exact title \"Catching up with friends\" and its participants. The `read_conversation` doesn't show titles, so let me use `list_recent_conversations` (which should show titles and update times). Also, I need the full saved apartments list to find 4-bedroom ones. Let me retry these.\nThe `list_recent_conversations` returned only the single most-recent conversation (participants +46734567890, +351912344678, +4586134211). I need to find the one titled exactly \"Catching up with friends\" and get more conversations. The saved apartments list is also being truncated. Let me retry with proper integer/boolean types.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-8e4fcf55-b253-4826-a081-834aa43ca375", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-df17e0e3-7061-4137-8c72-3460f5a7f280"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "add_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "title", "value": "Property Tour", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "start_datetime", "value": "2024-10-19 16:00:00", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "end_datetime", "value": "2024-10-19 17:00:00", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "tag", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "description", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "location", "value": "Lund Luxury Living, Klostergatan 15, Lund 222 22", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "attendees", "value": "[\"Åsa Lundqvist\",\"Astrid Rasmussen\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-1feb05f2-6fea-4477-b3aa-d4c35a893514", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-df17e0e3-7061-4137-8c72-3460f5a7f280"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Cabs", "function": "order_ride", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "start_location", "value": "Stora Södergatan 25, Lund", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "end_location", "value": "Klostergatan 15, Lund 222 22", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "service_type", "value": "Premium", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "ride_time", "value": "2024-10-19 15:00:00", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-a42a2763-7548-4afb-8388-e6f466083882", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-df17e0e3-7061-4137-8c72-3460f5a7f280"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Messages", "function": "send_message", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "user_id", "value": "+4531193456", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Hey Astrid, Property Tour is on Saturday, Oct 19, 4PM-5PM at Lund Luxury Living, Klostergatan 15, Lund 222 22", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "attachment_path", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-bcb3346d-72fa-458f-9b3f-fe89c6f84332", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-df17e0e3-7061-4137-8c72-3460f5a7f280"], "event_relative_ti