: 1728975634.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-a7286523-bea2-4cef-b17c-29aa40ca85e8", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-d4b72057-8dee-41a6-8710-c508a700e8a8"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "02132dcbdcde45d398fc2e114e502d69", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}], "score": 0.5, "em": 0.0, "method": "gaia2_official_actions", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "adaptability", "level": "unknown", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 585, "wc_served": [1.049, 1.049], "wc_mean": 1.049, "wc_active": 2, "wc_n": 2, "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.05, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "3dad207e", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "meta", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "3aa73f4d0bd6", "prof_total_s": 3201.66, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 3201.66, "prof_tok_in": 331123, "prof_tok_out": 5778, "prof_llm_calls": 17}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T14:26:25.351796", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_fk7puz", "task_desc": "Send an email to Joana Silva saying something urgent came up and I need to meet her today at 1 PM for 15 minutes. Add that to my calendar and name it “Talk with Joana”. Please tell me when you’ve scheduled the event and sent the email. If she can’t make it, reschedule the event for earliest time that she suggests, as long as I don’t have any other meetings at the same time, and reply to let her know.", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v2]\nTask: Send an email to Joana Silva saying something urgent came up and I need to meet her today \nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll start by gathering the information I need: finding Joana Silva's contact details, checking today's calendar, and confirming the current time.\nI found Joana\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> \n\nVersion lineage (later supersedes earlier):\n  v1 -> v2: score -30%", "response": "I'll start by gathering the information I need: finding Joana Silva's contact details, checking today's calendar, and confirming the current time.\nI found Joana's email (joana.silva@gaia2mail.com) and confirmed today's calendar. The 1 PM–1:15 PM slot is free (only Photoshoot 9–12, Networking 18–20, Self-Care 20–21). Let me send the email and add the calendar event.\nThe calendar event was created. The email failed because recipients must be a list. Let me retry.\nThe email was sent and Joana has already replied. Let me read her reply to see if she can make it at 1 PM or suggests an alternative time.\nThat's an older email. Let me check the inbox for the most recent email from Joana (her reply to my urgent request).\nThe parameters need to be integers. Let me retry with proper types.\nLet me search for Joana's reply using a query related to my message.\nLet me try reading the most recent email directly by index.\nLet me search by the subject of my sent email to find her reply.\nJoana can't make 1 PM. She suggests **1:45 PM** or **6 PM**. The earliest is 1:45 PM (13:45–14:00), and I have no meetings then (Networking is 18:00–20:00, so 6 PM would conflict anyway). I'll reschedule the event to 1:45 PM and reply to let her know.\nThe event is rescheduled. Now let me reply to Joana to confirm 1:45 PM works.\nAll tasks are complete. Let me summarize for you.\nAll tasks are complete:\n\n- **Email sent** to Joana Silva explaining the urgent situation and requesting a 1 PM / 15-minute meeting.\n- **Calendar event \"Talk with Joana\"** was added, then rescheduled to **1:45 PM–2:00 PM today** after Joana said she couldn't make 1 PM. I chose her earliest suggestion (1:45 PM) because 6 PM would have conflicted with your existing Networking Event (18:00–20:00).\n- **Reply sent** to Joana confirming 1:45 PM works and that the calendar was updated.\n\nThe meeting is now set for 1:45 PM today.\nNo new follow-up message arrived. The task is fully complete:\n\n- ✅ Email sent to Joana Silva about the urgent meeting\n- ✅ Calendar event \"Talk with Joana\" scheduled (rescheduled to 1:45 PM–2:00 PM after she couldn't make 1 PM, avoiding conflict with your 6 PM Networking Event)\n- ✅ Reply sent to Joana confirming 1:45 PM works\n\nI'll stop here since there's no further action required.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-2984866f-3766-4daf-a6ea-c774b9e06fc7", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-58c19a37-e8d1-4258-8667-bd0fd5f52c56"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"joana.silva@gaia2mail.com\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "Urgent Meeting Request", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Something urgent came up and I need to meet you today at 1 PM for 15 minutes.", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-fde9c444-5bf1-4720-87ff-3776b10c6bb2", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-58c19a37-e8d1-4258-8667-bd0fd5f52c56"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "add_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "title", "value": "Talk with Joana", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "start_datetime", "value": "2024-10-15 13:00:00", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "end_datetime", "value": "2024-10-15 13:15:00", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "tag", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "description", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "location", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "attendees", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975602.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-5fde7c61-d288-4a81-84f2-7e115eb77d33", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-fde9c444-5bf1-4720-87ff-3776b10c6bb2", "OracleEvent-AGENT-2984866f-3766-4daf-a6ea-c774b9e06fc7"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "AgentUserInterface", "function": "send_message_to_user", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "content", "value": "The event has been scheduled and the email has been sent.", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975843.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-efe3d5e7-1d5f-4774-82f6-6ac4ac9f67fb", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-cacebcb0-7ca1-4b15-b8b2-4e91ae9b7692"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app":