{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T14:30:20.891194", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_3ixhl6", "task_desc": "Cancel all scheduled events tagged as work at the Home Office starting from tomorrow through October 23rd, and order the same amount of the soft velour HANSA Snuggles The Bear Plush as the number of canceled events as this particular size and color has a sentimental value for us. If there is anything unclear, ping me so I can help.", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v2]\nTask: Cancel all scheduled events tagged as work at the Home Office starting from tomorrow throu\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll start by finding the work-tagged events and events at the Home Office. Let me gather this information.\nThe tag search was case-sensitive. The events have t\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> \n\nVersion lineage (later supersedes earlier):\n  v1 -> v2: score -10%", "response": "I'll start by understanding the task. I need to:\n1. Find and cancel work-tagged events at the Home Office from Oct 16-23\n2. Count them, then order that many \"soft velour HANSA Snuggles The Bear Plush\"\n\nLet me first check the current time and gather the relevant events.\nThe tag is \"Work\" (capitalized), not \"work\". Let me get the events in the target date range and by the correct tag.\nThe limit must be an integer. Let me retry the date range query.\nThe result is truncated. I need to see all events in the range. Let me try passing limit as an integer value.\nThe default limit of 10 truncated the results. Let me query day-by-day to capture all events in the range. I'll start with Oct 16.\nOct 16: 2 work events at Home Office (Content Creation Session, Social Media Management). Let me continue day by day.\nLet me continue with Oct 21-23.\nI've now collected all events from Oct 16-23. Let me identify the work-tagged events at \"Home Office\":\n\n**Work + Home Office events to cancel (8 total):**\n1. Oct 16 - Content Creation Session (7491df4dfb5d4586b3d43c0f4f9e81d5)\n2. Oct 16 - Social Media Management (15a8031c0f1e4e6c867b93b08a5d365b)\n3. Oct 17 - Content Creation Session (2c50e300723342fd890a082b5b19cbba)\n4. Oct 17 - Social Media Management (06551b52bea4471a87591728dfb818ab)\n5. Oct 18 - Content Creation Session (1b1df251b5044fab93d395277aff298a)\n6. Oct 20 - Content Creation Session (845a95a84b70414385a357118559ba0a)\n7. Oct 21 - Content Creation Session (8822dd753a8e4728abe46cbd63977d20)\n8. Oct 23 - Social Media Management (da2a225c7b9c4a9fb257699bfe065f13)\n\n(The Brand Partnership Meetings are at \"Zoom Meeting\", not Home Office, so they're excluded.)\n\nLet me delete these 8 events and search for the plush product in parallel.\nAll 8 work-tagged events at the Home Office (Oct 16–23) have been successfully canceled. \n\nNow, for the plush order: I found the \"HANSA Snuggles The Bear Plush\" with **Soft Velour** material, but there are three Soft Velour variants with different sizes/colors:\n- Small, Soft Velour, **Brown** ($140.69)\n- Medium, Soft Velour, **Brown** ($160.99)\n- Small, Soft Velour, **Gray** ($150.99)\n\nThe task references \"this particular size and color\" that has sentimental value, but it doesn't specify which one. Since this is genuinely unclear, I'll ping the user to clarify before placing the order.\nI've completed the calendar cancellation and pinged the user for clarification on the plush variant. Let me wait for their response.\nNo response yet. Let me wait a bit longer for the user's clarification on the plush variant.\nI've completed the calendar portion of the task and pinged the user for clarification on the plush variant. After waiting 10 minutes with no response, the task is now blocked on the user's input regarding which specific size/color of the Soft Velour HANSA Snuggles The Bear Plush to order.\n\n**Summary of completed work:**\n- ✅ Canceled all 8 work-tagged events at the Home Office from Oct 16–23 (2024)\n- ⏳ Plush order pending: awaiting user clarification on which Soft Velour variant (Small/Brown, Medium/Brown, or Small/Gray) to order 8 of\n\nThe calendar cancellations are done. Once the user specifies the size and color, I'll place the order for 8 units to match the number of canceled events.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-ce527ac1-f071-4b77-8dff-024c55aeafc4", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-2f630f35-e68d-4c45-ad6c-85f95dc1bd5d"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "15a8031c0f1e4e6c867b93b08a5d365b", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-f1ec1e47-753f-47a4-ad07-5594971ae2f9", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-2f630f35-e68d-4c45-ad6c-85f95dc1bd5d"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "7491df4dfb5d4586b3d43c0f4f9e81d5", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-ceb746f8-a308-4214-b1bc-1999aa8e3948", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-2f630f35-e68d-4c45-ad6c-85f95dc1bd5d"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "2c50e300723342fd890a082b5b19cbba", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-7c7d7877-