t_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "da2a225c7b9c4a9fb257699bfe065f13", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-3afa24a9-7598-40e2-bf7c-f22068ceaca8", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-2f630f35-e68d-4c45-ad6c-85f95dc1bd5d"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "AgentUserInterface", "function": "send_message_to_user", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "content", "value": "Which size and color of the soft velour HANSA Snuggles The Bear Plush would you like to order?", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}], "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "method": "gaia2_official_actions", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "ambiguity", "level": "unknown", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 578, "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.9, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "3dad207e", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "meta", "score_provenance": "self_assessment", "judge_model": "hy3", "protocol_hash": "3aa73f4d0bd6", "prof_total_s": 3664.91, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 3664.91, "prof_tok_in": 249248, "prof_tok_out": 6746, "prof_llm_calls": 13}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T14:30:48.543403", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_kgqyjr", "task_desc": "Send Åsa Lindström an email with the subject \"Flat Viewing\" which contains the names of all the Malmö properties in my saved list and tell her I’ll help her view them at 2pm this Sunday. On the same day, book a default cab to collect me from my home at 1:30pm to take me to the location of the Malmö Majestic property. Let me know when the cab is booked and Åsa Lindström has been emailed. \n\nIf Åsa Lindström sends an email mentioning an alternative date and time to view properties, cancel all event", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v2]\nTask: Send Åsa Lindström an email with the subject \"Flat Viewing\" which contains the names of al\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll start by gathering the information I need: my saved apartments, Åsa Lindström's contact details, my home location, and the Malmö Majestic property location\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> \n\nVersion lineage (later supersedes earlier):\n  v1 -> v2: score +5%", "response": "I'll break this task into sub-requests:\n1. Find all Malmö properties in my saved list\n2. Get Åsa Lindström's email\n3. Get my home location\n4. Get the Malmö Majestic property location\n5. Send the email to Åsa\n6. Book the default cab for Sunday 1:30pm\n7. Notify you when both are done\n8. Handle the conditional follow-up (if Åsa proposes alternative date/time)\n\nLet me start by gathering the needed information.\nI found Åsa's email and my home address (Stockholm). The saved apartments list was truncated. Let me search specifically for Malmö properties in my saved list and find the Malmö Majestic property.\nThe Malmö Majestic is at \"Malmöhusvägen 34, Malmö\". Let me retry the saved Malmö search with the correct boolean type, and also list all saved apartments to be thorough.\nThe `saved_only` parameter has a type issue. Let me search all apartments for Malmö to find all Malmö properties, then I'll cross-reference with my saved list.\nThe Malmö search shows several properties with saved status. The result was truncated. Let me get the complete picture by listing all apartments to identify all Malmö properties and their saved status.\nI have most Malmö properties identified. The search results were truncated at \"Malmö Central\". Let me get the details for Malmö Central to confirm its saved status, and verify the saved status of the Malmö properties I found. Let me also re-check the full saved list to ensure I'm not missing any Malmö properties.\nI now have a clear picture. The Malmö properties in my saved list are:\n- **Malmö Marina** (saved)\n- **Malmö Modern** (saved)\n- **Malmö Majestic** (saved)\n\n(The other Malmö properties — Malmö Öster, Malmö Möllan, Malmö Central — are not saved.)\n\nThis Sunday is 2024-10-20. Let me send the email to Åsa and book the default cab (home → Malmö Majestic) in parallel.\nThe cab is booked (ride_id: 4e3d1297833d3aa85facd3dd11a81ea4). The email failed because recipients must be a list. Let me retry.\nThe email was sent (id: 2f0bd5dcf7244cecd1fa8d2fea52b73f), and I see notifications that Åsa has sent new emails — this likely triggers the conditional part of the task. Let me read Åsa's emails to see the alternative date/time she proposed.\nÅsa proposed an alternative: **Wednesday 23rd October, 2pm–5pm** (2024-10-23 14:00–17:00). The other emails (cookies, old photos) are unrelated — I'll ignore them.\n\nNow I need to:\n1. Find & cancel events overlapping 2024-10-23 14:00–17:00\n2. Cancel the cab ride\n3. Message cancelled-event attendees on Chats\n4. Add \"Viewing Flats\" event on 2024-10-23 14:00–17:00\n5. Re-book cab for 13:30 on 2024-10-23\n\nLet me find conflicting calendar events and cancel the cab.\nOne conflicting event: \"Coffee Break with Linnea\" (2024-10-23 14:00–15:00), attendee Linnea Åström. The cab is cancelled. Let me cancel that event and look up Linnea's Chats user ID in parallel.\nEvent deleted and Linnea's Chats ID found. Now let me send a Chats message to Linnea about the cancellation, add the \"Viewing Flats\" event, and re-book the cab for 13:30 on 2024-10-23 — all in parallel.\nAll actions are complete. Let me verify the final state of the calendar and confirm there are no other overlapping events I missed.\nEverything is complete and verified. The calendar now correctly shows the new \"Viewing Flats\" event (14:00–17:00) with no remaining conflicts — the only overlapping event (\"Coffee Break with Linnea\") was cancelled, and the other two Wednesday events (09:00 and 20:00) don't overlap.\n\nLet me inform the user of the completed actions.\nThe task is fully complete. All sub-requests have been handled:\n\n1. **Email to Åsa Lindström** — Sent with subject \"Flat Viewing\" listing the saved Malmö properties (Malmö Marina, Malmö Modern, Malmö Majestic) and the 2pm Sunday viewing offer. ✅\n2. **Initial cab booking** — Default cab from home to Malmö Majestic at 1:30pm Sunday. ✅\n3. **Åsa's alternative (Wed 23 Oct, 2–5pm)** — Detected and acted on. ✅\n4. **Cancelled conflicting event** — \"Coffee Break with Linnea\" (overlapping 2–3pm). ✅\n5. **Cancelled the original cab** — Done. ✅\n6. **Notified cancelled-event attendees via Chats** — Messaged Linnea Åström. ✅\n7. **Added \"Viewing Flats\" event** — Wed 23 Oct, 2–5pm. ✅\n8. **Re-booked cab** — Default cab for 1:30pm Wed 23 Oct (half hour before new time). ✅\n9. **Ignored unrelated emails** — The cookie and old-photos emails were skipped. ✅\n\nI've reported the completion to the user.\nNo new follow-up message arrived during the wait. The task is fully complete — all sub-requests have been handled and verified:\n\n- ✅ Emailed Åsa Lindström (\"Flat Viewing\") with the saved Malmö properties (Malmö Marina, Malmö Modern, Malmö Majestic) and the 2pm Sunday offer\n- ✅ Booked the initial Default cab (home → Malmö Majestic, 1:30pm Sunday)\n- ✅ On Åsa's alternative proposal (Wed 23 Oct, 2–5pm): cancelled the conflicting \"Coffee Break with Linnea\" event, cancelled the original cab, messaged Linnea on Chats, added the \"Viewing Flats\" event, and re-booked the cab for 1:30pm Wed 23 Oct\n- ✅ Ignored unrelated emails\n\nNo further action is required.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-54555ece-7ce3-4a23-b640-5cbcbf78c705", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-c35d3482-9849-499d-8cc2-adc4fd9d3c55"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Cabs", "function": "order_ride", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "start_location", "value": "Home", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "end_location", "value": "Malmöhusvägen 34, Malmö", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "service_type", "value": "Default", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "ride_time", "value": "2024-10-20 13:30:00", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-dd69e374-1d9a-4210-81d6-078b7190f6ca", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-c35d3482-9849-499d-8cc2-adc4fd9d3c55"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"asa.lindstrom@gaia2mail.com\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "Flat Viewing", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Dear Åsa,\n\nI'll help you view the following Malmö properties at 2pm this Sunday:\n\n* Malmö Modern\n* Malmö Marina\n* Malmö Castle Views\n* Malmö Majestic\n* Malmö Marina View\n* Malmö Harbour\n* Malmö City Center\n\nBest,\nAstrid", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "v