{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T14:31:36.376859", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_5e0gvz", "task_desc": "I need to book a whole day with my friend who’s a Film Producer in Stockholm. Cancel any appointments I have scheduled for this upcoming Saturday and schedule an event titled “Film Production Day” from 8 AM to 8 PM on that day, adding my friend as an attendee. Send him an email after scheduling the event, with the appointment details. Let me know when you’ve done these things. If my friend says he can’t make it, accept any suggested date and time he proposes and reschedule the “Film Production D", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v2]\nTask: I need to book a whole day with my friend who’s a Film Producer in Stockholm. Cancel any a\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll start by gathering the information I need: finding my friend (Film Producer in Stockholm), confirming the current date, and getting my user details.\nThe se\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> \n\nVersion lineage (later supersedes earlier):\n  v1 -> v2: score +40%", "response": "I'll start by gathering the information I need: finding my friend (Film Producer in Stockholm), confirming the current date, and getting my user details.\nThe search returned no results. Let me search more broadly for my friend.\nLet me fix the offset parameter type and list all contacts.\nLet me get more contacts by scrolling through the list.\nThe offset parameter has a type issue. Let me try passing it as a number, and also search for the friend differently.\nI found my friend: **Åke Lindström**, a Film Producer in Stockholm (email: ake.lindstrom@filmproduktion.se).\n\nCurrent date is Tuesday, 2024-10-15, so the upcoming Saturday is **2024-10-19**. Let me check my calendar for that day.\nI have one appointment on Saturday: \"Brand Partnership Meeting\" (14:00–16:00). I'll cancel it and schedule the \"Film Production Day\" event from 8 AM to 8 PM, adding Åke as an attendee.\nThe appointment is cancelled and the event is scheduled. Now let me send Åke an email with the appointment details.\nThe recipients parameter needs to be a list. Let me fix that.\nI received a reply from Åke. Let me read it to see if he can make it.\nÅke can't make it Saturday and suggests **Thursday, October 17th at the same time (8 AM – 8 PM)**. I need to:\n1. Reschedule the \"Film Production Day\" event to Thursday, Oct 17, 8 AM–8 PM\n2. Cancel any appointments I have on Thursday, Oct 17\n\nLet me check my calendar for Thursday, Oct 17 first.\nI have 5 appointments on Thursday, Oct 17 that I need to cancel, and I need to reschedule the Film Production Day event. Let me cancel all 5 appointments first.\nAll 5 Thursday appointments are cancelled. Now I'll delete the Saturday Film Production Day event and create a new one on Thursday, Oct 17, 8 AM–8 PM.\nLet me verify the final calendar state for both days.\nEverything is confirmed. Thursday, Oct 17 now has only the \"Film Production Day\" event (8 AM–8 PM), and Saturday, Oct 19 is clear. Let me send Åke a brief confirmation email accepting his proposed date, then notify you.\nI've completed all the requested tasks. Here's the summary:\n\n**1. Found your friend:** Åke Lindström, a Film Producer in Stockholm (ake.lindstrom@filmproduktion.se).\n\n**2. Saturday, Oct 19 (upcoming Saturday):**\n- Cancelled your \"Brand Partnership Meeting\" (14:00–16:00).\n- Scheduled \"Film Production Day\" from 8:00 AM to 8:00 PM, with Åke as an attendee.\n\n**3. Sent Åke an email** with the appointment details.\n\n**4. Åke replied that he can't make it Saturday** and proposed **Thursday, October 17 at the same time (8 AM–8 PM).** Per your instructions, I:\n- Cancelled all 5 of your Thursday, Oct 17 appointments (Content Creation Session, Social Media Management, Brand Partnership Meeting, Yoga Class, Personal Project Work).\n- Rescheduled \"Film Production Day\" to Thursday, Oct 17, 8:00 AM–8:00 PM, with Åke as an attendee.\n- Sent Åke a confirmation email accepting his proposed date.\n\n**Final calendar state:**\n- Thursday, Oct 17: only \"Film Production Day\" (8 AM–8 PM) ✓\n- Saturday, Oct 19: clear ✓\n\nAll done!\nNo new follow-up message arrived during the wait. The task is fully complete:\n\n- ✅ Found your friend Åke Lindström (Film Producer in Stockholm)\n- ✅ Cancelled your Saturday, Oct 19 appointment and scheduled \"Film Production Day\" (8 AM–8 PM) with Åke as attendee\n- ✅ Sent Åke the appointment details email\n- ✅ Handled Åke's reply (he couldn't make Saturday, proposed Thursday, Oct 17 at the same time): rescheduled the event to Thursday, Oct 17 (8 AM–8 PM), cancelled all 5 of your Thursday appointments, and sent him a confirmation email\n\nBoth days are now in the correct state (Thursday, Oct 17 has only the Film Production Day; Saturday, Oct 19 is clear). Nothing further is pending.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 0.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-9ca29aa0-de61-43b9-8784-1181580bc6b2", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-18ffbb0b-c192-4b7d-8c98-352ac9ba1008"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "add_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "title", "value": "Film Production Day", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "start_datetime", "value": "2024-10-19 08:00:00", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "end_datetime", "value": "2024-10-19 20:00:00", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "tag", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "description", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "location", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "attendees", "value": "[\"Åke Lindström\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "Ora