{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T14:41:16.340097", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_30dro5", "task_desc": "Send a group email to Åsa Lindgren and Linnea Åström asking if they are planning to come to Yoga classes from today through October 27th. If Åsa Lindgren does not email back in the next 2 minutes after sending the email, then cancel the yoga classes they are a part of. If Linnea Åström does not email back in the next 4 minutes after sending the email, then cancel the yoga classes they are a part of as well. You don't need to notify me about anything.", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v2]\nTask: Send a group email to Åsa Lindgren and Linnea Åström asking if they are planning to come t\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll start by finding the contacts and the yoga classes on the calendar.\nLet me search specifically for Yoga classes and get the full list of events.\nLet me get\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> \n\nVersion lineage (later supersedes earlier):\n  v1 -> v2: score +85%", "response": "I'll start by finding the contacts for Åsa Lindgren and Linnea Åström, and identifying the yoga classes on the calendar.\nI found both contacts. Now let me find the yoga classes specifically in the date range from today (2024-10-15) through October 27th.\nThe result was truncated. Let me search specifically for Yoga classes and get the full list of events.\nThe search results are truncated. Let me search by attendee names to find yoga classes involving these specific people.\nI found Åsa's yoga classes. Now I need to verify Linnea's yoga classes. The search for Linnea returned no Yoga Class events, but results may be truncated. Let me get the complete list of yoga classes in the date range by splitting it into windows.\nThe search results are being truncated. Let me page through the events using offset to get the complete list for the date range. Let me first get the full list of yoga classes by paginating the date-range query.\nThe offset needs to be an integer. Let me retry.\nThe offset/limit parameters have type issues. Let me query the date range in smaller windows to avoid truncation and see all events. I'll batch day-range queries.\nI'm getting truncated results. Let me query individual days to get complete event lists for the days I haven't fully seen. I'll check each day in the range.\nNow let me check the remaining days (Oct 19, 20, 22, 23, 24, 26, 27) for any yoga classes.\nI now have a complete picture of the yoga classes. Let me compile:\n\n**Åsa Lindgren's Yoga Classes (Oct 15–27):**\n- d161b55ebc704647bc8d949977009093 — Wed Oct 16 18:00\n- fae4a56e0fba4243a08497fe47b6fb10 — Thu Oct 17 18:00\n- 3ee1ddd748ed44abb59443861ab2d658 — Fri Oct 18 18:00\n\n**Linnea Åström's Yoga Classes (Oct 15–27):**\n- 23ff2e41249940288e488a0fb8f5a756 — Mon Oct 21 18:00\n- b87b0e6f2b1a4f58a19e1bc5d694b315 — Fri Oct 25 18:00\n- be936d6b1c3a4e5480a82e571fe84079 — Sun Oct 27 18:00\n\nNow I need their email addresses. Let me search contacts.\nI have both email addresses. Now let me send the group email to both Åsa and Linnea. Let me first confirm the current time as the baseline for the reply windows.\nNow let me send the group email to both Åsa and Linnea.\nThe email is sent. Now I need to monitor for replies. Per the task:\n- If Åsa hasn't replied within 2 minutes → cancel her yoga classes\n- If Linnea hasn't replied within 4 minutes → cancel her yoga classes\n\nLet me wait ~2 minutes and then check the inbox for replies.\n2 minutes have passed. Let me check the inbox for any replies from Åsa or Linnea.\nNo replies from Åsa or Linnea yet. Let me search specifically for any emails from them.\nNo replies from either Åsa or Linnea within the 2-minute window (the only emails from them are old, pre-dating my message). The 2-minute deadline for Åsa has passed, so I'll cancel Åsa's yoga classes now. Then I'll wait until the 4-minute mark to check on Linnea.\n\nLet me cancel Åsa's three yoga classes.\nÅsa's three yoga classes are cancelled. Now I need to wait until the 4-minute mark (from email send) to check on Linnea. The email was sent at sim_time 1728975769, so the 4-minute deadline is 1728976009. Let me wait the remaining ~105 seconds.\n4 minutes have now passed since the email was sent. Let me check the inbox again for any reply from Linnea (or Åsa).\nNo new replies from Linnea (the only email from her is from August, well before my message). The 4-minute deadline has passed, so I'll cancel Linnea's three yoga classes.\nLet me verify the final state of the yoga classes to confirm all are cancelled.\nLet me verify the specific Oct 15–27 yoga classes are all gone by querying that date range.\nThe task is fully complete. Verification confirms there are no remaining Yoga Class events with Åsa Lindgren or Linnea Åström as attendees in the Oct 15–27 range (all six were successfully deleted).\n\nSummary of actions taken:\n1. ✅ Sent a group email to Åsa Lindgren (asa.lindgren@gaia2mail.com) and Linnea Åström (linnea.astrom@gaia2mail.com) asking if they're planning to come to Yoga classes Oct 15–27.\n2. ✅ Waited 2 minutes — no reply from Åsa → cancelled her 3 yoga classes (Oct 16, 17, 18).\n3. ✅ Waited 4 minutes — no reply from Linnea → cancelled her 3 yoga classes (Oct 21, 25, 27).\n4. ✅ Per instructions, no notification was sent to the user.\n\nThe task is done, so I'll stop here.\nTask complete. I've delivered the final summary to the user.\n\nTo recap the completed work:\n- **Group email sent** to Åsa Lindgren and Linnea Åström asking about Yoga class attendance (Oct 15–27).\n- **Åsa's 3 yoga classes** (Oct 16, 17, 18) cancelled after no reply within 2 minutes.\n- **Linnea's 3 yoga classes** (Oct 21, 25, 27) cancelled after no reply within 4 minutes.\n- Verified no remaining yoga classes with either as attendees in the date range, and per instructions, no notification was sent during the process.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-20b66006-d871-4f85-8b82-b1a211e49a99", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-18fe979d-4b22-4408-9c9b-bc138b58854e"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"asa.lindgren@gaia2mail.com\",\"linnea.astrom@gaia2mail.com\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "Upcoming Yoga Classes - Confirmation Needed", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Dear Åsa and Linnea,\n\nAre you planning to attend the yoga classes scheduled from today through October 27th?", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975721.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-3cfa0b38-dc34-4bff-a2f8-1ff7f9ed4a0e", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-20b66006-d871-4f85-8b82-b1a211e49a99"], "event_relative_time": 120.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "3ee1ddd748ed44abb59443861ab2d658", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975721.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-73edfb31-d478-4d8b-9787-cae05245bc48", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-20b66006-d871-4f85-8b82-b1a211e49a99"], "event_relative_time": 120.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "fae4a56e0fba4243a08497fe47b6f