{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T14:43:04.032302", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_nc6nqf", "task_desc": "Please send an individual email to all the attendees of today’s events, asking if they are still able to attend. Also, order the \"Party Pictures Game\" for teenagers. Let me know once the emails have been sent. If any attendee informs me that they won’t be able to make it, cancel its respective event, even if it includes more attendees. After you do that, go ahead and send a message to the attending person(s) on Chats to notify them that the event has been cancelled. Ask them to reschedule. Addit", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v2]\nTask: Please send an individual email to all the attendees of today’s events, asking if they are\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll start by examining today's calendar events to find the attendees, and simultaneously look up the \"Party Pictures Game\" product.\nI found today's events and \nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> \n\nVersion lineage (later supersedes earlier):\n  v1 -> v2: score -45%", "response": "I'll start by examining today's calendar events to find the attendees, and simultaneously look up the \"Party Pictures Game\" product.\nI found today's events and the product. Let me analyze:\n\n**Today's events with attendees:**\n- Photoshoot (09:00-12:00): Kasper Rønnow\n- Networking Event (18:00-20:00): Astrid Mikkelsen, Beshoy Gadallah\n- Self-Care Routine (20:00-21:00): no attendees\n\nI need to email Kasper Rønnow, Astrid Mikkelsen, and Beshoy Gadallah. Let me find their contact details and add the teenagers variant of the game to the cart.\nI have all three contacts' emails. The cart call failed due to a type issue with quantity. Let me retry the cart add and send the individual emails to each attendee.\nThe cart add succeeded. The emails need recipients as a list. Let me retry them.\nAll three emails are sent. Now let me checkout the cart to order the \"Party Pictures Game\" (teenagers variant).\nThe order is placed (order f80ddfa2445846569024d006a69b7f2b). I also received email replies from all three attendees. Let me read them to determine who can't attend.\nI've received all three replies. Let me analyze:\n\n- **Beshoy Gadallah** (Networking Event): \"I confirm that I will be attending\" → ATTENDING\n- **Kasper Rønnow** (Photoshoot): \"Unfortunately, I won't be able to attend the photoshoot today\" → CANNOT ATTEND\n- **Astrid Mikkelsen** (Networking Event): \"Yes, I'm still attending\" → ATTENDING\n\nOnly Kasper cannot attend. The Photoshoot event (09:00-12:00) has only Kasper as an attendee, so I'll cancel it. Let me cancel the event and look up Kasper's Chats user ID.\nThe Photoshoot event is cancelled. Now I'll notify Kasper (the attendee of the cancelled event) on Chats that the event has been cancelled and ask him to reschedule, and create a \"rest time\" event at home for the cancelled time slot (09:00-12:00).\nAll tasks are complete. Let me provide a summary to the user.\nThe task is fully complete. Let me wait for any follow-up from the user.\nNo further notifications arrived. The task has been fully completed:\n\n1. ✅ Sent individual emails to all attendees of today's events (Kasper Rønnow, Astrid Mikkelsen, Beshoy Gadallah) asking if they can still attend.\n2. ✅ Ordered the \"Party Pictures Game\" (Teenagers variant) — order f80ddfa2445846569024d006a69b7f2b.\n3. ✅ Processed replies: Beshoy and Astrid confirmed attendance; Kasper could not attend → cancelled the Photoshoot event.\n4. ✅ Sent a Chats message to Kasper notifying him of the cancellation and asking to reschedule.\n5. ✅ Created a \"Rest Time\" event at Home for the cancelled slot (09:00–12:00).\n\nI've already reported all details to you. The task is done.\nNo new follow-up message arrived. The task remains fully complete:\n\n1. ✅ Sent individual emails to all attendees of today's events (Kasper Rønnow, Astrid Mikkelsen, Beshoy Gadallah) asking if they can still attend.\n2. ✅ Ordered the \"Party Pictures Game\" (Teenagers variant) — order f80ddfa2445846569024d006a69b7f2b.\n3. ✅ Processed replies: Beshoy and Astrid confirmed attendance; Kasper could not attend → cancelled the Photoshoot event.\n4. ✅ Sent a Chats message to Kasper notifying him of the cancellation and asking to reschedule.\n5. ✅ Created a \"Rest Time\" event at Home for the cancelled slot (09:00–12:00, event ID a6f807f2c8c09795b8351b2eef49916a).\n\nThe Networking Event (18:00–20:00) remains scheduled since both Astrid and Beshoy confirmed attendance. Nothing further is pending.", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-5ee176a0-95fc-4370-aa66-78199c471b79", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-6f496b01-f8a3-4578-9741-c116c4b4b660"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"kasper.ronnow@gaia2mail.com\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "Confirmation of Attendance for Today's Photoshoot", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Dear Kasper,\n\nAre you still able to attend the photoshoot today?\n\nBest,\nAstrid Lundqvist", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-cdacf16e-aead-4d50-bc11-e41c13f00793", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-6f496b01-f8a3-4578-9741-c116c4b4b660"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"astrid.mikkelsen@gaia2mail.com\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "Confirmation of Attendance for Today's Networking Event\n", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Dear Astrid Mikkelsen,\n\nAre you still able to attend the networking event today?\n\nBest regards,\nAstrid Lundqvist", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-ad70af5f-bb3c-4b84-bf7e-4369c83f7b19", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-6f496b01-f8a3-4578-9741-c116c4b4b660"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Emails", "function": "send_email", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "recipients", "value": "[\"beshoy.gadallah@coptic-church.dk\"]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "subject", "value": "Confirmation of Attendance for Today's Networking Event\n", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Dear Beshoy Gadallah,\n\nAre you still able to attend the networking event today?\n\nBest regards,\nAstrid Lundqvist", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "cc", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}, {"name": "attachment_paths", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-b7d0db48-7b2b-4cfb-b76a-75119b2a7c08", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-6f496b01-f8a3-4578-9741-c116c4b4b660"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Shopping", "function": "add_to_cart", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "item_id", "value": "aa6c8f2fa37146779d967aecf049b413", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "quantity", "value": "1", "value_type": "int"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975602.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-641b0601-34d9-44ab-8a92-e19277b69f6b", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-5ee176a0-95fc-4370-aa66-78199c471b79", "OracleEvent-AGENT-cdacf16e-aead-4d50-bc11-e41c13f00793", "OracleEvent-AGENT-ad70af5f-bb3c-4b84-bf7e-4369c83f7b19"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "AgentUserInterface", "function": "send_message_to_user", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "content", "value": "All the emails have been sent.", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975602.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-6b3774ef-5635-478d-aeaf-b561c0398eab", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-b7d0db48-7b2b-4cfb-b76a-75119b2a7c08"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Shopping", "function": "checkout", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "discount_code", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975723.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-9bb0ebdb-28fe-4690-9a65-c51eb8ec1773", "dependencies": ["Event-ENV-6dcd53ec-b7f8-41e9-bb46-d2978c074655"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "delete_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "event_id", "value": "d2f892cf34ab4e16be08eb6dbfd01727", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975724.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-663e460b-c62a-4abf-a126-15fe585df4e3", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-9bb0ebdb-28fe-4690-9a65-c51eb8ec1773"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Chats", "function": "send_message", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "user_id", "value": "5f06df26-d63b-4ac1-84d9-8b81e60ae733", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "content", "value": "Hi Kasper, the photoshoot today has been canceled. Reschedule it for when you can attend.", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "attachment_path", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975724.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-47920f94-1521-4dfa-bd9d-d6d0987a5982", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-9bb0ebdb-28fe-4690-9a65-c51eb8ec1773"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "Calendar", "function": "add_calendar_event", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "title", "value": "rest time", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "start_datetime", "value": "2024-10-15 09:00:00", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "end_datetime", "value": "2024-10-15 12:00:00", "value_type": "str"}, {"name": "tag", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "description", "value": "", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "location", "value": "Home", "value_type": "Optional[str]"}, {"name": "attendees", "value": "[]", "value_type": "list[str]"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975725.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-2cc4fe58-2248-43ef-87d1-de121f8c2db4", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-47920f94-1521-4dfa-bd9d-d6d0987a5982"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "AgentUserInterface", "function": "send_message_to_user", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "content", "value": "A \"rest time\" event was created today, from 9 AM to 12 PM.", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}], "score": 0.8, "em": 0.0, "method": "gaia2_official_actions", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "adaptability", "level": "unknown", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 558, "wc_served": [1.05, 1.05], "wc_mean": 1.05, "wc_active": 2, "wc_n": 2, "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.5, "fb_mode": "self", "code_rev": "3dad207e", "critic_model": "grok-4.5", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy":