{"timestamp": "2026-07-24T14:58:26.529485", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_22_3sml2v", "task_desc": "Save all New York apartments I haven't already saved and then let me know how many new listings were saved.", "augmented_prompt": "## Curated prior attempts (this task's chain)\n\n[Prior attempt — store version v2]\nTask: Save all New York apartments I haven't already saved and then let me know how many new lis\nAnswer given then (unverified): I'll start by gathering the data I need: all apartments in the catalog and the apartments I've already saved.\nThe results are truncated. Let me search specifica\nActions used:  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  ->  -> \n\nVersion lineage (later supersedes earlier):\n  v1 -> v2", "response": "I'll start by gathering the data I need: all apartments in the catalog and the apartments I've already saved.\nThe results are truncated. Let me search specifically for New York apartments in the catalog, and also get the full list of saved apartments.\nThe search results are being truncated. Let me narrow down by searching for New York apartments that are already saved (smaller list) to identify which ones I have, and also try to enumerate the full New York list in smaller chunks.\nThe `saved_only` parameter needs a boolean value. Let me retry.\nThe `saved_only` parameter has a type issue. Let me instead break the New York search into smaller chunks using additional filters to avoid truncation. I'll search by number of bedrooms.\nThe numeric filters have type issues when passed as strings. Let me try splitting the New York search by price ranges, since price parameters are typed as strings.\nThe numeric filters have type issues. Let me try searching by zip code (New York zip codes start with \"100\"), which is a string parameter.\nThe numeric filters have type issues. The New York search is being truncated in display. Let me try to narrow the results using string-based filters (property_type) to get complete, non-truncated results.\nThe display is being truncated. Let me search by specific New York zip codes to get smaller, complete result sets.\nI've found 5 New York apartments so far, but the location search was truncated, so there may be more. Let me search by furnished status to get complete (non-truncated) result sets and ensure I capture all New York listings.\nI'm getting more complete results now. The Furnished search was truncated at \"Park Place\" (38ded46f7a814625a88c06dbbe5bd455). Let me get its details and search the remaining New York zip codes (10028, 10003) to ensure I capture everything.\nI now have a complete picture of all New York apartments. Let me compile the findings:\n\n**New York apartments found (7 total):**\n1. The Vue (10013) — already saved\n2. Aurora Heights (10024) — not saved\n3. Parkside Residences (10021) — not saved\n4. The Lexington (10021) — not saved\n5. Soho Oasis (10012) — not saved\n6. Park Place (10028) — not saved\n7. New York Nest (10003) — already saved\n\nThe Furnished + Semi-furnished searches (Unfurnished returned empty) cover all NY apartments, and I've confirmed each via zip-code searches. So 5 apartments need to be saved. Let me save them all.\nAll 5 saves succeeded. Let me verify by listing the saved apartments to confirm the count.\nThe saved list is truncated. Let me verify the 5 New York apartments I saved now show as saved by checking their details directly.\nAll 5 New York apartments are now confirmed as saved. The task is complete.\nDone! I found 7 New York apartments total. Two were already saved (The Vue and New York Nest), so I saved the remaining 5 that you hadn't saved yet:\n\n1. Aurora Heights (10024) – $2,800\n2. Parkside Residences (10021) – $3,500\n3. The Lexington (10021) – $3,000\n4. Soho Oasis (10012) – $2,800\n5. Park Place (10028) – $3,000\n\n**5 new listings were saved.**", "expected": [{"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-4d600a4c-bf05-401f-8a78-46807a027e9f", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-d4662dc8-d4b9-4c0e-9235-19ab74914914"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "RentAFlat", "function": "save_apartment", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "apartment_id", "value": "df71f4dbe1334b7d9c7517e92caa7b31", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-443a2133-cd94-401c-b8c6-3e3887aec3b2", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-d4662dc8-d4b9-4c0e-9235-19ab74914914"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "RentAFlat", "function": "save_apartment", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "apartment_id", "value": "ab3c928ced1042b3afc6323c03b3f4dd", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-6170fed4-9862-4620-96f1-9514cee54db8", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-d4662dc8-d4b9-4c0e-9235-19ab74914914"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "RentAFlat", "function": "save_apartment", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "apartment_id", "value": "185a973528014a37840b3496081019e6", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-6949fd5e-ed6e-474b-ad35-1dee6decc120", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-d4662dc8-d4b9-4c0e-9235-19ab74914914"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "RentAFlat", "function": "save_apartment", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "apartment_id", "value": "a31094b1d29a488bafb50ef8c383491a", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-a9f932fa-2dd9-431c-b7be-89b9b29a1ac4", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-d4662dc8-d4b9-4c0e-9235-19ab74914914"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "RentAFlat", "function": "save_apartment", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "apartment_id", "value": "38ded46f7a814625a88c06dbbe5bd455", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975601.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-39e1df7b-2e3b-41c4-9f6d-29a1598fd476", "dependencies": ["Event-USER-d4662dc8-d4b9-4c0e-9235-19ab74914914"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "RentAFlat", "function": "save_apartment", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "apartment_id", "value": "4ac63b62b69b4c7d9d4c471ba88f2f4e", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}, {"class_name": "OracleEvent", "event_type": "AGENT", "event_time": 1728975602.0, "event_id": "OracleEvent-AGENT-460e5ea0-d56a-4716-8d71-eaea33114e06", "dependencies": ["OracleEvent-AGENT-4d600a4c-bf05-401f-8a78-46807a027e9f", "OracleEvent-AGENT-443a2133-cd94-401c-b8c6-3e3887aec3b2", "OracleEvent-AGENT-6170fed4-9862-4620-96f1-9514cee54db8", "OracleEvent-AGENT-6949fd5e-ed6e-474b-ad35-1dee6decc120", "OracleEvent-AGENT-a9f932fa-2dd9-431c-b7be-89b9b29a1ac4", "OracleEvent-AGENT-39e1df7b-2e3b-41c4-9f6d-29a1598fd476"], "event_relative_time": 1.0, "action": {"action_id": "", "app": "AgentUserInterface", "function": "send_message_to_user", "operation_type": null, "args": [{"name": "content", "value": "Six new New York apartments were saved.", "value_type": "str"}]}, "metadata": null}], "score": 0.5714285714285714, "em": 0.0, "method": "gaia2_official_actions", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "execution", "level": "unknown", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 642, "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.1, "fb_mode": "self", "code_